      "quiz_not_quite": "Ma aha si buuxda.",
      "myth35_1_s": "Cannonball culus si dhaqso ah ayuu u dhacaa, sidaas darteed wuu hore u degaa.",
      "myth35_1_why": "Gravity wuxuu si siman u dardargeliyaa mass KASTA (marka air drag damsan yahay) — kubbadda 10 kg iyo kubbadda 1 kg waxay sawiraan arc isku mid ah saxda ah. Fikradda weyn ee Galileo.",
      "myth35_1_tryit": "Tuur mass = 1 kg, ka dibna jiid mass ilaa 10 kg oo mar kale tuur. Arc isku mid ah, meel degitaan isku mid ah.",
      "myth35_2_s": "Peak-ga arc-ga, kubbaddu way joojisay dhaqaaqa.",
      "myth35_2_why": "Kaliya qaybta kor-hoos ee motion-ka ayaa joogsata peak-ga. Kubbaddu si joogto ah ayay hore u sii socotaa.",
      "myth35_2_tryit": "Shid Vectors oo daawo horizontal arrow peak-ga arc-ga — waligiis ma yaraado.",
      "myth35_3_s": "Labanlaabista launch speed waxay labanlaabtaa distance.",
      "myth35_3_why": "Distance wuxuu u koraa sida speed × speed. Labanlaab speed, wuxuuna degi doonaa AFAR jeer ka fog.",
      "myth35_3_tryit": "Tuur 15 m/s, ka dibna 30 m/s angle isku mid ah — isbarbardhig landing marks.",
      "myth35_4_s": "Ku bartilmaameedsiga 45° ayaa u tuuraya kan ugu fog (hawo la'aan).",
      "myth35_4_why": "Low angles si siman ayay u duulaan laakiin aad bay u dhacaan; high angles waxay speed ku lumiyaan fuulista. 45° waa heshiis kaamil ah.",
      "myth35_4_tryit": "Orod complementary-angle demo — 30° iyo 60° waxay degaan xitaa meel isku mid ah.",
      "myth68_1_s": "Launch ka dib, force ayaa sii wataya inuu kubbadda hore u riixo.",
      "myth68_1_why": "Isla marka uu ka baxo cannon-ka, force-ka KELIYA waa gravity oo hoos toos u jiidaya. Forward motion wuu sii socdaa maxaa yeelay wax jooji ma jiro — Newton's first law.",
      "myth68_1_tryit": "Daawo vector overlay inta uu duulayo: ma jiro forward force, hase yeeshee Vx si buuxda joogto ah ayuu u ahaanayaa.",
      "myth68_2_s": "Kubbadda horizontal loo tuuray iyo kubbadda height isku mid ah laga sii daayay waxay dhulka taabtaan isla waqtigii.",
      "myth68_2_why": "Horizontal iyo vertical motion way madax banaan yihiin. Labada kubbadood waxay ku dhacaan gravity isku mid ah height isku mid ah, sidaas darteed way wada degaan.",
      "myth68_2_tryit": "Tuur angle aad u hooseeya oo isbarbardhig flight time tuur gaaban oo dheer oo height isku mid ah ka yimid.",
      "myth912_1_s": "Air Drag oo Shidan, 45° wali waa angle-ka ugu wanaagsan.",
      "myth912_1_why": "Drag wuxuu ciqaabaa duullimaadyada dhaadheer ee sarreeya — wuxuu cunaa v² dariiqa oo dhan. Optimum wuxuu hoos ugu dhacaa qiyaastii 30-40° iyadoo ku xiran speed.",
      "myth912_1_tryit": "Shid air drag oo maree angle slider — daawo halka landing mark uu dhab ahaan peak ku gaadho.",
