      "aria_explorer_sections": "Qaybaha Sahamiyaha Nidaamka Deegaanka",
      "hero_explore_title": "Sahami shabakadda cuntada",
      "hero_explore_hint": "Guji nooc kasta si aad u aragto waxa uu cuno iyo waxa isaga cuna. Silsiladaha heerarka quudinta way caddaanayaan — ka saar ugaarsadaha ugu sarreeya oo daawo nidaamka oo dib isu habaynaya.",
      "hero_sandbox_title": "Goobta Tijaabada — nidaamkaaga deegaanka",
      "hero_sandbox_hint": "Ku dar soo saarayaal, isticmaalayaal iyo ugaarsadayaal; daawo dhaqdhaqaaqa tirada oo soo baxaya. Wareegyada Lotka-Volterra way muuqdaan marka aad haysato hal ugaarsade + hal ugaadh + waxba kale.",
      "hero_conserve_title": "Maamulaha Ilaalinta — xaaladda Maine",
      "hero_conserve_hint": "Sahami xaalad waxbarasho oo 10 sano ah oo ka duulaysa Maine. Qiimayaasha tirada, deegaanka iyo taageerada dadweynaha waa tilmaamayaal 0-100, xeerarka silsiladdana gacan baa lagu qoray, mana aha saadaal.",
      "hero_inquiry_title": "Baaritaan — dhaqdhaqaaqa ugaarsade-ugaadh",
      "hero_inquiry_hint": "Habee dhalmada ugaarsadaha, cimriga ugaadha iyo yaraanta kheyraadka. Fiiri nidaamku heerkee gooni ah uu ku degayo. Dhibco ma jiraan, wax la muujinayo ma jiraan, jawaabo la shubayo ma jiraan — kaliya dhaqaajinta sliiderka iyo indho-indhaynta.",
      "hero_quiz_title": "Su'aalo — fikradaha aasaasiga ah",
      "hero_quiz_hint": "Lix su'aalood oo daboolaya daahitaanka ugaarsade-ugaadh, ujeeddada moodeelka, ugaarsiga, awoodda qaadista, soo saarayaasha aasaasiga ah iyo heerarka quudinta.",
      "hero_badges_title": "Calaamado — waxa aad baratay",
      "hero_badges_hint": "Guulaha waxay xusaan fikradaha deegaanka ee aad muujisay, ma aha kuwa aad booqatay oo keliya. Calaamadda silsiladda quudintu waxay ku leedahay inaad dhab ahaan mid ka kicisid goobta tijaabada.",
      "goal_label": "Ujeeddo: ",
      "explore_goal_body": "isbarbardhig habaynta soo saarta wareegyo, yaraansho ama burbur moodeelladan waxbarashada. Heerarka sare ee ugaarsadayaashu badanaa way ka daahaan kuwa ugaadha, laakiin inta ay daahitaanku le'eg tahay waxay ku xidhan tahay doorsoomayaasha. Canvas-ka dhaqaaqayaa wuxuu adeegsadaa xeerar kala duwan oo random ah; garaafka hoosena wuxuu adeegsadaa isla'egta go'an ee logistic ee ugaarsade-ugaadh.",
