      "thinking": "Waa fikirayaa...",
      "sandbox_goal_body": "naqshadee tijaabooyin. Isku day habaynta buugga ee Lotka-Volterra (1 ugaarsade + 1 ugaadh, waxba kale) oo daawo wareegga. Kaddibna jebi: ku dar ugaarsade labaad (saarid tartan), ama gebi ahaanba ka saar ugaarsadaha (ugaadhu way ka gudubtaa awoodda qaadista wayna burburtaa). Ku dar dhacdooyin si aad u tijaabiso adkaysiga. Nooc kasta oo la dhigo waxaa xakameeya Awoodda Qaadista (K) ee sliiderka hoose.",
