      "experiment_ideas": "Fikrado Tijaabo",
      "exp_idea_1": "Ka saar dhammaan ugaarsadayaasha oo daawo waxa ku dhaca ugaadha iyo dhirta",
      "exp_idea_2": "Samee \"darbi\" geedo ah oo eeg inuu saameeyo habka ugaarsiga iyo in kale",
      "exp_idea_3": "Hal mar ku dar dawacooyin badan, kaddibna kici Cunto Badan si aad u badbaadiso bakaylayaasha",
      "exp_idea_4": "Jooji, geeso ku dhig ugaadha halka kalena ugaarsadayaasha, kaddibna sii wad",
      "exp_idea_5": "Kici Dab Duur kaddibna isla markiiba ku dar geedo si aad u aragto soo kabashada",
      "tip_wolf_priority": "U socod soo celinta yeeyda IYO kordhi xadka ugaarsiga deerada",
      "tip_wolf_text_pre": "Deerooyinku aad bay u badan yihiin (",
      "tip_wolf_text_post": " tilmaame) yeeyduna ma joogto. Ugaarsadayaal la'aan, deerooyinku waxay burburiyaan deegaan kasta cadaadiska daaqa. Laba tallaabo oo isku mar ah: kordhi xadka ugaarsiga deerada si aad degdeg u fududayso, oo bilow safarka dheer ee soo celinta yeeyda (Sanduuqa magdhowga + Waxbarid dadweyne si taageerada yeeyda kor loogu qaado 50 ka sarreeya, iyo sidoo kale Ilaalinta deegaanka si deegaanka yeeydu uga sarreeyo 60).",
      "tip_salmon_priority": "Soo celinta durdurrada ee salmon iyo trout",
      "tip_salmon_text_pre": "Salmon-ka Atlantic aad buu u yar yahay (",
      "tip_salmon_text_post": "). Soo celinta durdurradu waxay hal tallaabo ku caawisaa salmon, brook trout iyo beaver. Ka saarista biyo-xidheenka waa qalab weyn laakiin waxay ku kacaysaa taageerada dadweynaha.",
      "tip_hold_priority": "Xasilooni ku sii soco oo dhulka akhri",
      "tip_hold_text": "Ma jirto hal aag oo dhibaato ku jira. Isticmaal Sannadka 1 si aad ula socoto oo aad u ilaaliso deegaanka; xeerarka silsiladdu waxay sannadaha soo socda kordhin doonaan tallaabooyinkaaga.",
