      "iq_discovery_title": "Helitaanka ugaarsade-ugaadh",
      "iq_intro": "Dhaqaaji saddex sliider fikradeed oo barbardhig kala-soociye miisaaman oo aan qaabaysnayn. Summadaha waa kicin baaritaan, ma aha xalal Lotka-Volterra, saadaal tiro ah, ama heerar deegaan oo la cabbiray.",
