      "iq_hypo_placeholder": "Sliiderkee ayaa UGU muhiimsan kicinta burburka? Ma dheelitiri kartaa nidaamka iyadoo dhalmada ugaarsaduhu 80% tahay? Qor aragtidaada.",
      "iq_stuck_btn": "Waan istaagay — i tus su'aalo aan ka fikiro (jawaabo la'aan)",
      "open_questions": "Su'aalo furan — baadh adigoo beddelaya:",
      "iq_q1": "Ku bilow saddexda oo dhan 50%. Natiijo maxaad heshay? Hadda si tartiib ah u kordhi dhalmada ugaarsadaha. Halkee ayay xaaladdu ku rogmataa?",
      "iq_q2": "Sarreysii dhalmada ugaarsadaha (80%). Ma badbaadin kartaa nidaamka adigoo KELIYA beddelaya cimriga ugaadha? Haddaad beddesho yaraanta kheyraadka oo kaliya?",
