      "iq_q4": "Qor 4-5 indho-indhayn xaalad kasta (kororid, dheelitiran, burbur). Ka raadi qaabab shaxda — ma jiraan xadad hal doorsoome, mise way is dhaafsadaan?",
      "iq_q5": "Waxtarka wareejinta tamarta deegaanku wuu ku kala duwan yahay nidaamyada; qiyaastii 10% waa oo keliya tilmaan waxbarasho oo guud. Xog dheeraad ah oo noocee ah ayaad u baahan lahayd si aad socodka tamarta ugu xidho badnaanta ugaarsadayaasha?",
      "no_answers_revealed": "Jawaabo lama muujin doono. Baadh.",
