      "pilot_sc_desertBasin_label": "Dooxada lamadegaanka",
      "pilot_sc_mountainWinter_blurb": "Qabow oo qallalan. Heerka barafoobiddu wuxuu u dhow yahay dhulka, sidaas darteed baraf baad noqonaysaa, ma aha roob.",
      "pilot_sc_mountainWinter_label": "Xilliga qabowga buuraha",
