      "pilot_you_are_cooler_than_the_air_around_you": "Waad ka qabow tahay hawada ku hareeraysan, sidaas darteed waxaad u baahan tahay kor u qaadis si aad u sii kacdo.",
      "pilot_you_are_warmer_than_the_air_around_you": "Waad ka diirran tahay hawada ku hareeraysan, kor baadna u kacaysaa adigoo keliya.",
      "pilot_you_have_now_been_through_all_six_stag": "Hadda waxaad soo martay lixda marxaladood oo dhan. Meel kasta oo aad ku soo degto waxay kugu dirtaa jid kala duwan: isku day inaad ku soo degto dhul cidla ah, kayn, iyo harada si aad u barbardhigto inta mid walba ku hayo.",
