      "a_quiet_year": "Sannad xasilloon",
      "no_major_event_routine_fieldwork_stead": "Dhacdo weyn ma jirto. Shaqo goob caadi ah, horumar joogto ah.",
      "watershed_recovery": "Soo kabashada aagga biyaha",
      "the_watershed_is_healing_across_the_bo": "Aagga biyuhu wuxuu ka bogsanayaa dhinacyada oo dhan. Isha biyuhu way qaboobaan oo nadiif ah. Durdurka weyn ayaa mar kale kalluun sida. Dhul-qoyan beaver-ku waxay qabtaan shaqada bannaanka daadka. Sidan ayay u eg tahay soo kabashada heerka aagga biyaha marka wakhtiga iyo bulshadu midoobaan.",
      "recovering_watershed": "Aag biyo soo kabanaya",
      "most_components_are_improving_a_few_st": "Qaybaha badankoodu way hagaagayaan. Dhowr ayaa weli u baahan shaqo. Jihada way fiican tahay, bulshaduna way ka qaybqaadanaysaa.",
      "mixed_recovery": "Soo kabasho isku dhafan",
      "some_wins_some_gaps_real_watershed_wor": "Qaar guul, qaar farqi. Shaqada dhabta ah ee aagga biyuhu naadir ayay u simataa; qaybo ayaa hagaagay halka kuwa kale ay istaageen.",
      "slipping_watershed": "Aag biyo hoos u dhacaya",
      "average_quality_is_low_and_few_compone": "Tayada celceliska ah way hooseysaa, dhowr qaybood ayaana gaaray heerarka soo kabashada. Sidan ayay aagagga biyuhu si aamusan u sii xumaadaan marka maaraynta aysan la socon karin cadaadiska.",
      "initial_conditions_look_workable_use_y": "Xaaladaha bilowga ah waxay u muuqdaan kuwo la samayn karo. Isticmaal Sannadka 1 kormeerka sayniska muwaadinka iyo waxbarashada, si aad u dhisto taageero bulsho ka hor inta aadan ku bixin ficillada muranka leh sida ka saarista biyo-xireennada.",
      "watershed_deep_dive": "Falanqayn qoto dheer oo aagga biyaha",
      "close": "✕ Xir",
      "hydrology": "💧 Cilmiga biyaha",
      "case_work": "📰 Shaqo kiis",
