      "what_you_can_do_for_this_component": "🛠 Waxaad u qaban karto qaybtan",
      "component_quality_across_the_10_year_c": "📈 Tayada qaybta inta lagu jiro ololaha 10 sano",
      "year_by_year_quality_trend_chart_by_wa": "Jaantuska isbeddelka tayada sannad-sannad ee qayb aagga biyaha",
      "ai_watershed_educator_is_reading_your_": "⏳ Macallinka aagga biyaha ee AI wuxuu akhrinayaa xogtaada aagga biyaha...",
      "ai_watershed_reading": "Akhriska aagga biyaha ee AI",
      "ai_watershed_reading_2": "Akhriska aagga biyaha ee AI",
      "re_read": "↻ Dib u akhri",
      "ai_watershed_science_educator": "Macallinka sayniska aagga biyaha ee AI. ",
      "it_is_not_a_wabanaki_person_not_a_real": "Ma aha qof Wabanaki ah, ma aha isuduwe aag biyo dhab ah ama khabiir cilmiga biyaha, mana hadlo magaca umad, hay'ad ama urur Wabanaki ah.",
      "for_authoritative_voices_on_maine_wate": " Codad awood leh oo ku saabsan shaqada aagga biyaha ee Maine, la tasho Penobscot Nation Cultural and Historic Preservation Department, Wabanaki Public Health and Wellness, Atlantic Salmon Federation, Maine Coast Heritage Trust, Maine Audubon, Maine Soil and Water Conservation Districts, iyo Maine Department of Environmental Protection.",
      "water_cycle_explorer": "← Baadhaha Wareegga Biyaha",
      "watershed_steward_maine_campaign": "💧 Ilaaliyaha Aagga Biyaha: olole Maine",
      "watershed_steward_10_year_maine_campai": "Ilaaliyaha Aagga Biyaha: olole Maine 10 sano",
      "six_watershed_components_ten_years_rea": "Lix qaybood oo aagga biyaha, toban sano, cadaadis dhab ah oo Maine: caqabadaha biyo-xireenka, biyo-qulqul beeraley, biyaha roobka magaalooyinka, daadad iyo abaaro cimilo keentay. ",
      "hydrological_feedback_rules_tie_them_t": "Xeerarka jawaab-celinta cilmiga biyaha way isku xirayaan.",
      "healthy_buffers_cool_headwater_streams": "Xeebaha caafimaadka qaba waxay qaboojiyaan durdurrada isha webiga. Dhul-biyoodyada beaver-ku waxay yareeyaan fatahaadaha oo nadiifiyaan durdurka weyn. Biyaha yar ee beeraha ka soo qulqulaya ayaa u oggolaanaya webiga inuu neefsado. Webiyada isku xiran ee hooska leh waxay soo celiyaan socodka salmoon iyo alewife. Natiijooyinku waa tilmaamayaal waxbarasho oo gacanta lagu qoray, ma aha cabbir goob ah, saadaal, ama dammaanad mashruuc.",
