      "equip_each_piece_of_ppe_before_proceed": "Xidho qayb kasta oo qalabka ilaalinta ah ka hor inta aadan sii wadin. Shaybaadhka dhabta ah, ma taaban kartid kiimikooyinka adiga oo aan lahayn ilaalin buuxda.",
      "equipped_protected": "✔ La xidhay — La ilaaliyay",
