      "find_each_piece_of_safety_equipment_on": "Hel qayb kasta oo qalabka badbaadada ah khariidada shaybaadhka. Xaalad degdeg ah oo dhab ah, ilbiriqsiyadu waa muhiim — waa inaad ogaataa meesha wax walba yaalaan ka hor inta aadan bilaabin.",
