      "fix_ratio_at_1_0_sweep_pka_from_2_to_1": "Ku hagaaji saamiga 1.0. Ka mari pKa 2 ilaa 12. Qiimayaal pKa qaar ma buffer ka wanaagsan yihiin dabiici ahaan? Maxay sidaas u noqon kartaa?",
      "set_pka_4_74_acetic_acid_sweep_ratio_f": "Deji pKa = 4.74 (aashito acetic). Ka mari saamiga 0.05 ilaa 20. Saamiyada kee ayuu buffer ku sii jiraa? Ma jiraa «sanduuq wanaagsan» is-simid ah oo saamiga ku jira?",
      "find_one_good_buffer_then_change_one_s": "Hel hal buffer wanaagsan. Ka dibna beddel hal slider ilaa uu noqdo mid xun. Isbeddel kaliya oo kee ah ayaa ugu waxtar badan?",
      "log_4_5_good_buffers_with_different_pk": "Diiwaangeli 4-5 buffer wanaagsan oo leh qiimayaal pKa kala duwan. Maxay pH bilowgooda ku wadaagaan pKa-gooda?",
      "in_real_biochemistry_blood_is_buffered": "Biochemistry dhabta ah, dhiigga waxaa loo buffer sameeyaa pH 7.4 — pKa kee ayaa ugu habboon nidaamka buffer-kaas? Baar adigoo raadinaya buffer phosphate iyo bicarbonate.",
