      "explain_in_your_own_words_what_is_the_": "Ku sharax erayadaada gaarka ah: waa maxay xiriirka u dhexeeya pKa, saamiga, iyo pH bilowga? Xaalad kaliya oo kee ah (ama isku-dar) ayaa buffer ka dhigaya mid u adkeysta aashito badan? Maxay kala-duwanaanshaha saamigu muhiim u yahay?",
      "saved_notice_nobody_checked_your_answe": "✓ Waa la kaydiyay. Xusuusin — qofna ma eegin jawaabtaada. Kani waa dabeecadda baarista uu ardaygu hoggaamiyo.",
      "design_note_no_buffer_capacity_score_n": "Xusuusin naqshadeed: ma jiro qiimo awoodda buffer, ma jiro badhan daahfur, ma jiro hubin imtixaan. Natiijada waxaa loo muujiyaa 2 xaaladood oo kala duwan (wanaagsan / xun) halkii laga heli lahaa qiime joogto ah — si ula kac ah, si loo yareeyo dabeecadda hagaajinta. Wax muhiimka ah waa baarista, maaha tiro.",
      "methyl_red": "Casaanka methyl-ka",
      "at_half_equivalence_e_equals_e0": "Kala-badhka sinnaanta, saddexmeeleh Fe²⁺ ayaa la oksaydiyay — badhkiis sax ah — sidaas darteed [Fe³⁺] = [Fe²⁺], qaybta logarithm-ka ee isla'egta Nernst way eber noqotaa, elektroodhkuna wuxuu tusayaa E° lammaanaha laftiisa — dhigga redox ee pH = pKa.",
