      "redox_potentiometric_explainer": "Titration-ka redox waxaad ku raacdaa elektroodh platinum ah oo ku xiran potentiometer. Sinnaanta ka hor, lammaanaha Fe³⁺/Fe²⁺ ayaa go'aamiya awoodda; ka dib, lammaanaha hadhay ee MnO₄⁻/Mn²⁺ ayaa qaata. Boodada ku dhow toosnaanta ee labada u dhaxaysa waa dhibcaha dhammaadka.",
      "redox_colour_and_formal_potential": "Dhibcaha dhammaadka indhaha ayaad ku arki kartaa — permanganate-ku waa tilmaamihiisa: markuu falgalo wuxuu ka beddelmaa guduud-cirro ilaa midab-la'aan, sidaas darteed casaanka khafiifka ah ee ugu horreeya ee sii jira wuxuu ka dhigan yahay in raad ka hadhay. Laba xaqiiqo oo daacad ah: H₂SO₄ dhab ah oo 1 M ah, lammaanaha birtu wuxuu hoos ugu dhacaa awood rasmi ah oo u dhow 0.68 V sababtoo ah sulfate-ku wuxuu xidhaa Fe³⁺; 0 mL saxda ah awooddu ma qeexna (weli Fe³⁺ ma jiro) — qalooca wuxuu ka bilaabmaa raadka Fe³⁺ ee oksaydhka hawadu had iyo jeer ka tago.",
