      "demand_shifted_left_fewer_people_want_": "▶ Baahidu waxay u beddeshay bidix — dad yar ayaa rabo alaabtan (beddelku wuu jabay, ama doorbidku wuu beddelay). Qiimaha iyo tiradu labaduba way hoos u dhacaan.",
