      "flight_3d_hint": "Fly through a dimensional migration corridor with species-specific flocking, terrain, route beacons, wind, camera views, and an explicit Monarch relay simulation.",
      "flight_3d_title": "3D migration flight",
      "flyways_legend": "Flyways",
