      "interactive_climate_explorer_emissions": "Muujinta jadwalka wakhtiga qiiqa ee Climate Explorer oo isdhexgal ah",
      "annual_global_co2_emission_rate": "Heerka qiiqa CO2 caalamiga ah ee sannadlaha ah",
      "baseline_today_s_coastlines": "Salka — xeebaha maanta.",
      "locked_in_at_1_5_c_sustained_warming_m": "Ku xidhan ~1.5°C kuleyl socda. Intooda badan la-qabsiga xeebaha ayaa weli suurtogal ah oo leh derbiyada badda, dib-u-gurasho la maareeyo.",
      "associated_with_2_5_c_warming_displace": "La xiriira ~2.5°C kuleyl. Waxay barakiciyaa dad ka badan dagaal kasta oo taariikhda. Mowjadda duufaanta waxay noqotaa masiibo gobollada gudaha.",
      "likely_by_2300_at_3_c_entire_nations_l": "U badan 2300 3°C. Qaramo dhan ayaa lumiya dhul la deggan karo. New Orleans, Venice, iyo qayb weyn oo Vietnam.",
      "multi_century_commitment_at_4_c_warmin": "Ballan qarniyo badan 4°C kuleyl. Waxay u baahan tahay burburka Greenland + Antarctica Galbeed. Juqraafiga xeebaha ee ilbaxnimada aadanaha si joogto ah ayaa dib loo qoraa.",
      "locked_in_with_greenland_most_of_west_": "Ku xidhan Greenland + inta badan Antarctica Galbeed oo lumay. Xeeb ka kulul xilligii Pliocene. Qarniyo ilaa kun sannadood si buuxda loo dhaqangeliyo.",
