      "net_zero_plus_equity": "Eber Saafi iyo Sinnaan",
      "you_hit_deep_decarbonization_across_se": "Waxaad gaadhay kaarboon-yareyn qoto dheer oo dhinacyada dhan ah, waxaad dhistay adkaysi, waxaadna sinnaanta dhigtay bartamaha. Sidan ayay u eg tahay kala-guur cimilo oo guulaystay marka heshiiska bulshadu uu sii jiro.",
      "decarbonized_but_uneven": "Kaarboon la Saaray laakiin Aan Sinnayn",
      "significant_decarbonization_across_the": "Kaarboon-yaraynta muhiimka ah dhinacyada tamarta iyo gaadiidka, laakiin la-qabsiga iyo caddaaladda ayaa dib u dhacay. Qaloocyada kaarboonku waa sax; isbahaysiga siyaasadeed waa dabacsan yahay.",
      "partial_progress": "Horumar Qayb ah",
      "some_sectors_moved_others_stalled_publ": "Qaar ka mid ah dhinacyada ayaa horay u socday. Kuwo kale way istaageen. Taageerada dadweynaha ayaa dhimatay muddo ka dib. Kani waa waddada uu siyaasadaha cimilada ee dhabta ah intiisa badan mareen.",
      "climate_policy_failure": "Guuldarada Siyaasadda Cimilada",
      "decarbonization_stalled_adaptation_gap": "Kaarboon-yaraynta way istaagtay. Farqiga la-qabsiga ayaa ballaadhay. Taageerada dadweynaha ayaa burburtay. Kani waa waddada aan isku dayno inaan ka fogaanno: saameynta cimilada oo isku uruurta iyada oo aan jirin kaabayaal bulsho ama farsamo oo lagu jawaabo.",
      "initial_conditions_are_workable_spread": "Xaaladaha bilowga ah way shaqayn karaan. Ku kala firi maalgashiga 2-3 dhinac xilliga kowaad si aad u hesho xeerarka feedback-ka ee ugu horreeya shaqeeya. Waxbarashada dadweynaha + shirarka muwaadiniinta waxay bixiyaan gunno tartiib ah laakiin adkaysi leh.",
      "ai_climate_policy_reading": "Akhriska Siyaasadda Cimilada AI",
