      "chaperones_hsp70_groel_help_proteins_f": "Chaperone (Hsp70, GroEL) waxay ka caawiyaan protein inuu si sax ah u laalaabto. Post-translational modification — phosphorylation, glycosylation, cleavage, disulfide bond.",
