      "codon_changes_different_amino_acid_eff": "Codon wuu beddelmaa → amino acid ka duwan. Saameyn laga bilaabo midna ma jirto (conservative substitution) ilaa mid daran (sickle cell — Glu→Val).",
      "codon_changes_stop_codon_truncated_pro": "Codon wuu beddelmaa → STOP codon. Protein waa la gooyaa, inta badan non-functional.",
      "adds_nucleotide_s_if_not_a_multiple_of": "Wuxuu ku daraa nucleotide. Haddii aanay ahayn multiple ee 3, reading frame wuu dhaqaaqaa → codon-yada hoose oo dhan way beddelmaan. Inta badan daran.",
