      "random_source_of_new_genetic_variation": "Isha bakhtiyaa nasiibka ah ee genetic variation cusub. Inta badan neutral ama waxyeello leh; dhif ah faa'iido leh. substrate-ka selection.",
      "random_changes_in_allele_frequency_esp": "Isbeddellada bakhtiyaa nasiibka ah ee allele frequency, gaar ahaan population yar. Founder effect + bottleneck waa tusaalooyin xad-dhaaf ah.",
