      "real_time_pitch_trace_volume_meter_fil": "Raadraaca sarraynta codka waqtiga dhabta ah + cabbir-cod + tirshe-erayo buuxin. Kuwa la tababaray waxay beddelaan sarraynta codka ~30% weedh gudaheed; soo bandhigid siman waxay lumisaa fiirada dhegeystaha gudaha ~20 ilbiriqsi.",
      "practice_work_through_a_delivery": "Ku celceli — ka shaqee soo bandhigid",
      "pacing_target_150_wpm_pauses_between_i": "Bartilmaameedka xawaaraha ~erayo 150/daqiiqad. Joojinta u dhaxaysa fikradaha (1-2 ilbiriqsi) waxay culays le'eg tahay erayada. Marka hore akhri qoraalkaaga cod dheer; jumlado xun ayaa isla markiiba muujiya.",
      "multilingual_same_speech_multiple_lang": "Luqado badan — isla khudbad, luqado badan",
      "speech_rate_varies_dramatically_by_lan": "Heerka hadalku aad buu ugu kala duwan yahay luqadda: Isbaanish + Jabbaan ~shibbano 7/ilbiriqsi; Ingiriis ~6; Mandarin ~5. Heerka macluumaadku waa mid ku dhawaad joogto ah — luqadaha cufan si tartiib ah ayaa loo hadlaa.",
      "report_your_delivery_analytics": "Warbixin — falanqaynta soo bandhigiddaada",
      "pace_pitch_range_filler_word_density_p": "Xawaare, xadka sarraynta codka, cufnaanta erayada buuxinta, waqtiga joojinta — mid kasta waxaa loo qiimeeyaa bartilmaameedyo cilmi-baaris taageertay. Guji cabbir kasta si aad u aragto tixraac + talo tababar.",
      "prosody_discover_how_delivery_shapes_m": "Luuqda — ogow sida soo bandhigiddu u qaabeyso macnaha",
      "adjust_pitch_offset_pace_and_volume_ga": "Hagaaji beddelka sarraynta codka, xawaaraha, iyo kordhinta codka, ka dibna qor waxa aad ka fiirsato. Dhibco ma jiraan, muujin ma jirto — samee mala-awaalkaaga sababta ay khudbadaha TED intooda badan ugu dhow yihiin erayo 150/daqiiqad.",
      "slow_deliberate": "🐢 Gaabis / miyir-qab",
      "suited_to_emphasis_reflection_gravitas": "Ku habboon xoojin, milicsi, culays.",
      "conversational_2": "🗣 Wada sheekaysi",
      "default_for_most_speaking_natural_rhyt": "Caadi ahaan hadalka badankiisa. Laxan dabiici ah.",
      "fast_urgent": "⚡ Degdeg / degdeg",
      "conveys_excitement_urgency_energy": "Waxay gudbisaa xiiso, degdeg, tamar.",
      "sprint": "🚀 Orod",
      "too_fast_comprehension_drops": "Aad u degdeg ah — fahamku wuu hoos u dhacaa.",
      "prosody_discovery": "⚙️ Ogaanshaha luuqda",
      "adjust_pitch_offset_pacing_volume_disc": "Hagaaji beddelka sarraynta codka, xawaaraha, codka. Kala saarid gaar ah oo 4-xawaare. Dhibco ma jiraan, muujin ma jirto.",
      "hypothesis_how_does_pace_affect_audien": "Mala-awaal: Sidee xawaaruhu u saameeyaa fahamka daawadayaasha?",
      "most_ted_talks_are_150_wpm_investigate": "Khudbadaha TED intooda badan waa ~erayo 150/daqiiqad. Baar sababta.",
      "when_does_pitch_variation_help_vs_dist": "Goorma ayay kala duwanaanshaha sarraynta codka caawisaa iyo goorma ay maskaxda kala qaadaan?",
      "explain_how_prosody_shapes_oratory_imp": "Sharax sida luuqdu u qaabeyso saameynta khudbadaynta.",
      "design_note_discrete_4_tempo_marker_no": "Xusuus naqshadeed: calaamad gaar ah oo 4-xawaare; dhibco soo bandhigid ma jiraan; muujin ma jirto — si ula kac ah.",
      "this_tool_is_designed_as_a_tier_1_clas": "Qalabkan waxaa loo naqshadeeyay sida faragelin fasal Heerka 1. Daaweynta hadalka gaarka ah, fadlan la tasho khabiir hadal shahaado leh.",
      "visualizations_use_web_audio_api_pitch": "Muujintu waxay isticmaalaan ogaanshaha sarraynta codka Web Audio API (isku-xirnaan) iyo falanqaynta ballaca. Dhammaan farsamaynta waxay ku dhacdaa gudaha browserka — cod ma jiro oo la duubo ama la gudbiyo.",
