      "pitch_detective_2": "Baadhaha Dhawaaqa Codka",
      "sing_into_the_mic_the_lab_tracks_frequ": "Ku hees makarafoonka; shaybaadhku wuxuu la socdaa inta-jeer waqtiga dhabta ah. Heesaayaasha la tababaray waxay ku hayaan dhawaaqa codka gudaha ±5 cents (1/20 nuska-codka) — sidan ayuu u dhawaaqaa cod-waafajin dhammaystiran.",
      "vocal_range_your_tessitura": "Xadka Codka — tessitura-daada",
      "most_untrained_voices_span_1_5_2_octav": "Codadka aan la tababarin badankood waxay ku fidaan 1.5-2 oktaf; heesaayaasha caadiga ah ee la tababaray waxay gaadhaan 3 ama in ka badan. Ballaadhinta xadka waxay inta badan ku saabsan tahay isku-darka rejistarrada, ee ma aha oo keliya jiidista kor iyo hoos.",
      "vibrato_lab_2": "Shaybaadhka Vibrato",
      "healthy_vibrato_5_7_hz_oscillation_60_": "Vibrato caafimaad qaba: ruxmad 5-7 Hz, oo leh ballac ~60-100 cents. Ka gaabis ah = ruxid; ka dhakhso badan = gariir. Vibrato waa shaqada taageerada neefsashada oo nasan, ee ma aha farsamo gaar ah.",
      "interval_singer_ear_training": "Heesaaha Farqiga Codka — Tababarka Dhegta",
      "major_3rd_vs_minor_3rd_is_the_single_m": "Saddexaadka weyn iyo saddexaadka yar waa labada farqi ee ugu wareersan bilaabayaasha. Calaamadaha xusuusta: saddexaadka weyn = \"Oh when the saints\", saddexaadka yar = \"Greensleeves\". Waxay dhistaa dhegaysi la xiriira.",
      "lip_trills_sirens_before_any_sustained": "Ruxmada bushimaha + sireeno ka hor hees kasta oo muddo dheer socota. 5-10 daqiiqo kululayn xoog-yar ah waxay hoos u dhigtaa khatarta isticmaalka xad-dhaafka ah ee xarkaha codka kalabar. Ka boodista kululaynta waa sababta lambar 1 ee dhaawacyada codka ee laga hortagi karo.",
      "sight_reading_2": "Akhrinta Qoraalka",
      "solf_ge_do_re_mi_letter_names_for_sigh": "Solfège (do-re-mi) way ka fiican tahay magacyada xarfaha akhrinta qoraalka sababtoo ah shaqallada waxay siraan xiriirrada farqiga codka, ee ma aha oo keliya astaamaha dhawaaqa codka. Do socda way ka fiican tahay do go'an muusikada codka leh.",
