      "base_10_blocks_ones_tens_hundreds_thou": "Base-10 Blocks — mid-mid, toban-toban, boqol-boqol, kun-kun",
      "the_whole_point_of_place_value_made_ta": "Ujeeddada oo dhan ee place value oo laga dhigay wax LA TAABAN KARO. Mid 10 = toban 1; toban 10 = boqol 1; boqol 10 = kun 1. Regrouping (carrying / borrowing) way caddaataa marka aad gacmahaaga ku beddesho blocks.",
      "abacus_4_500_years_of_mental_arithmeti": "Abacus — 4,500 oo sano oo xisaabta maskaxda",
      "soroban_japanese_and_suanpan_chinese_a": "Soroban (Jabbaan) iyo Suanpan (Shiine) weli waa la baraa — khubarada waxay kaga adkaadaan calculators xawaaraha dhibaatooyin badan. Rod kastaa waa place value; xaaladda beads AYAA ah tirada. Laga bilaabo wax la taaban karo ilaa maskaxda bilo gudahood.",
      "slide_rule_logarithms_in_your_hand": "Slide Rule — logarithms gacantaada",
      "how_engineers_multiplied_before_electr": "Sida injineerada u isku dhufan jireen ka hor calculators-ka elektroonigga ah: hagaaji logarithmic scales, akhri jawaabta. Apollo 11 (1969) waxay xisaabta orbit ku samaysay slide rules. Waa la beddelay oo dhan kaliya ka dib markii HP-35 soo baxay 1972.",
      "quiz_graded_place_value_arithmetic": "Quiz — place value iyo arithmetic dhibco leh",
      "ccss_1_nbt_2_nbt_3_nbt_4_nbt_progressi": "Kala horreynta CCSS 1.NBT, 2.NBT, 3.NBT, 4.NBT. Nidaamka concrete-pictorial-abstract (CPA, Bruner 1966) waa lafdhabarta curriculum kasta oo xisaabeed oo si fiican loo naqshadeeyay ee dugsiga hoose.",
      "ten_frames_the_k_2_number_sense_workho": "Ten Frames — tiirka number sense ee K-2",
      "a_5_by_2_grid_fill_cells_to_show_a_num": "Grid 5 ku 2. Buuxi cells si aad u muujiso tiro. Subitizing (garashada isla markiiba iyada oo aan la tirin) halkan ayay ka koraan. CCSS K.OA.A.4: su'aasha \"maxaa sameeya 10?\" waa albaabka fluency arithmetic oo dhan ee soo socda.",
      "two_color_counters_integers_concrete": "Two-Color Counters — integers oo la taaban karo",
      "yellow_1_red_1_a_yellow_red_pair_0_a_z": "Jaalle = +1; guduud = -1. Lammaane jaalle + guduud = 0 (\"zero pair\"). Model-ka ugu caddahay ee lagu fahmo negative numbers iyo integer arithmetic. CCSS 6.NS.C.5, 7.NS.A.1.",
      "place_value_disks_bridge_to_algorithm": "Place-Value Disks — buundo loo maro algorithm",
      "each_disk_labeled_with_its_value_1_10_": "Disk kastaa waxaa lagu qoray qiimihiisa (1, 10, 100, 1000). U dhaqaaji 10 disks oo nooc ah si aad ugu beddesho 1 qiimaha xiga. Buundada fikirka laga bilaabo blocks jireed ilaa standard algorithm. CCSS 4.NBT.B.4.",
      "hundreds_chart_count_pattern_and_skip": "Hundreds Chart — tiri, pattern, iyo bood",
      "a_10x10_grid_of_1_100_click_to_highlig": "Grid 10x10 oo ah 1-100. Guji si aad u iftiimiso cells. Skip-count overlays waxay muujiyaan patterns isku-dhufashada. CCSS 2.NBT.A.2: skip-counting 5, 10, 100.",
      "pattern_blocks_fractions_symmetry": "Pattern Blocks — fractions iyo symmetry",
      "hexagon_trapezoid_rhombus_triangle_squ": "Hexagon, trapezoid, rhombus, triangle, square, rhombus dhuuban. Trapezoids 2 = hexagon 1 (sidaas darteed trapezoid 1 = 1/2 hexagon). Rhombi 3 = hexagon 1 (sidaas darteed rhombus 1 = 1/3). Triangles 6 = hexagon 1 (sidaas darteed triangle 1 = 1/6).",
      "geoboard_polygons_on_a_peg_grid": "Geoboard — polygons grid pegs ah",
      "connect_pegs_with_rubber_bands_to_make": "Isku xir pegs adigoo isticmaalaya \"rubber bands\" si aad u samayso polygons. Cabbir perimeter iyo area. Qalabka dhaqameed ee la taaban karo ee plane geometry iyo Pick's theorem.",
      "cuisenaire_rods_numbers_in_color": "Cuisenaire Rods — tirooyin midab leh",
      "belgian_teacher_georges_cuisenaire_195": "Macallin reer Belgium Georges Cuisenaire (1952): 10 rods, dherer 1-10, mid kastaa midab kala duwan. Ku dar rods si aad u samayso tirooyin cusub. Cad=1, guduud=2, cagaar khafiif=3, guduud-buluug=4, jaalle=5, cagaar madow=6, madow=7, bunni=8, buluug=9, oranji=10.",
      "number_bonds_part_part_whole": "Number Bonds — part-part-whole",
      "the_whole_splits_into_two_parts_singap": "Guudku wuxuu u kala baxaa laba qaybood. Singapore Math ayaa tan ka dhigtay udub-dhexaad. CCSS K.OA.A.3: u kala qaybi 10 lammaanayaal. Tani waxay u dhistaa jidka isugeynta iyo kala-goynta oo dhan.",
      "fraction_bars_compare_and_add_fraction": "Fraction Bars — isbarbardhig oo isku dar fractions",
      "equal_length_bars_partitioned_into_hal": "Bars dherer isku mid ah oo loo kala qaybiyay kala badh, saddex-meelood, afar-meelood, lix-meelood, siddeed-meelood, iyo laba-iyo-toban-meelood. Isku dul saar si aad u isbarbardhigto. Hel kuwa isle'eg indhaha. Qalabka kaliya ee ugu nadiifsan fraction equivalence (3.NF, 4.NF).",
      "algebra_tiles_model_expressions_and_eq": "Algebra Tiles — samee model expressions iyo equations",
      "a_tile_for_1_unit_x_variable_x_square_": "Tile loogu talagalay 1 (unit), x (variable), x² (square). Laba midab: positive iyo negative. Samee model expressions sida 2x + 3 ama factor quadratics adigoo tiles u habaynaya rectangles. CCSS 7.EE, 8.EE.",
      "cra_progression_concrete_picture_equat": "CRA Progression — concrete → sawir → equation",
      "bruner_1966_students_master_each_conce": "Bruner (1966): ardaydu waxay bartaan concept kasta iyagoo maraya saddex hab oo representation ah. Waxaan kugu marinaynaa DHIBAATADA ISKU MID AH saddexda hab oo dhan si abstract symbol uu asal ugu yeesho shay aad ARKI karto oo aad TAABAN karto.",
      "challenge_hub_quick_practice_across_ev": "Xarunta Tartanka — tababar degdeg ah manipulative kasta",
      "random_problems_spanning_all_12_manipu": "Dhibaatooyin random ah oo daboolaya dhammaan 12-ka manipulatives. Waxaa loo naqshadeeyay distributed practice (Cepeda et al. 2006): set gaaban oo shan daqiiqo ah, oo noocyada isku qasa, ayaa ka wanaagsan labaatan daqiiqo oo nooc keliya oo isku xigta.",
      "glossary_math_vocabulary_with_examples": "Qaamuus — erayada xisaabta, iyo tusaalooyin",
      "vocabulary_is_the_curriculum_a_student": "Erayadu WAA curriculum-ka. Arday maqla \"regroup,\" \"compose,\" \"decompose,\" \"fluently,\" iyo \"place value\" marar badan macnaha guud dhexdiisa wuxuu nidaamka gudaha u geli doonaa. Qeexitaannada waxaa lagu xiray manipulative-ka gaarka ah ee mid kasta muujiya.",
      "brain_teasers_classic_math_puzzles": "Halxiraalayaal — puzzles dhaqameed oo xisaabeed",
      "classic_problems_that_are_solvable_sat": "Dhibaatooyin dhaqameed oo la xallin karo, qanciya, oo inta badan ka fudud marka manipulative gacanta ku jiro. Waxay u fiican yihiin warm-up, hawlo waqti buuxin, ama hawlo barroosin oo doodda fasalka ah.",
      "history_math_tools_through_time": "Taariikh — qalabka xisaabta waqtiyada dhexdooda",
      "counting_bones_lebombo_35_000_bce_sume": "Lafo tirin (Lebombo, ~35,000 BCE) → tokens Sumer → abacus Roomaan → Cuisenaire rods (1952) → maanta. Manipulative kasta oo qalabkan ku jira waa qayb ka mid ah abtirsiin dheer oo qalab waxbarasho.",
      "curriculum_map_which_tool_which_grade": "Khariidadda Curriculum — qalabkee, gradekee",
      "a_k_5_progression_chart_showing_which_": "Chart kala horreyn K-5 oo muujinaya manipulatives-ka caadi ahaan lagu soo bandhigo gradekee iyo standards-ka ay taageeraan. Guji cell kasta si aad u furto qalabkaas.",
      "activity_cards_printable_lessons": "Kaararka Hawlaha — casharro la daabici karo",
      "ready_to_print_activity_cards_for_smal": "Kaararka hawlaha oo diyaar u ah daabacaad koox yar ama fasal dhan. Kaar kastaa wuxuu magacaabayaa ujeeddo, qalab, tallaabooyin, iyo su'aal balaadhin. Waxaa loo naqshadeeyay in la isticmaalo IYADOO AAN app-kan la haysan — laakiin sidoo kale waad ku mari kartaa app-ka gudihiisa.",
      "help_faq_2": "Caawimaad & FAQ",
      "quick_reference_answers_to_common_stud": "Jawaabo degdeg ah oo ku saabsan su'aalaha caadiga ah ee ardayda iyo macallimiinta, iyo keyboard shortcuts, macluumaadka accessibility, iyo sida loola xiriiro taageerada AlloFlow.",
