      "all_cards": "Dhammaan kaararka:",
      "cards_are_designed_to_be_printed_and_u": "💡 Kaararka waxaa loo naqshadeeyay in la daabaco oo laga isticmaalo shaashadda dibaddeeda. Manipulatives jireed oo dhab ah weli way ka wanaagsan yihiin kuwa virtual K-2 — kinesthetic loop ayaa muhiim ah. ",
      "the_app_gives_you_every_manipulative_o": "App-ku wuxuu ku siinayaa MANIPULATIVE KASTA gacanta, xitaa marka kit-ka jireed uusan qolka ku jirin.",
      "faq": "❓ FAQ",
      "shortcuts": "⌨ Shortcuts",
      "pitfalls": "⚠ Godad",
      "about": "ℹ Ku saabsan",
      "keyboard_shortcuts": "Keyboard shortcuts:",
      "treating_manipulatives_as_filler_not_i": "U arkista manipulatives \"waqti buuxin\" maaha waxbarid",
      "common_mistake_handing_out_blocks_and_": "Khalad caadi ah: qaybinta blocks oo dabadeed baxsasho. Waxbarid cad oo XIRIIRINAYSA manipulative iyo symbol la'aanteed, ardaydu inta badan waxay la ciyaaraan alaabta waxna cusub ma bartaan. Had iyo jeer fadhi kasta oo manipulative ku soo gabagabee: \"I tus warqadda waxa aad hadda samaysay.\"",
      "keeping_students_on_the_concrete_stage": "Ardayda ku haynta marxaladda concrete waqti dheer",
      "a_4th_grader_who_still_needs_blocks_fo": "Ardayga grade 4 ee weli U BAAHAN blocks 23 + 47 dhibaato ayuu leeyahay. Blocks-ku waxay ahaayeen scaffold; haddii aan waligood la qaadin, fluency ma korto. U gudub representational (sawirro) grade 2-3, ilaa abstract (symbols) grade 3-4. Dib ugu noqo concrete oo kaliya concepts cusub.",
      "skipping_the_representational_stage": "Ka boodista marxaladda representational",
      "most_rushed_teachers_go_from_blocks_st": "Macallimiinta badan ee degdegga ah waxay ka gudbaan blocks si toos ah \"hadda qor 4 + 5 = 9.\" Taasi waxay ka boodaysaa marxaladda iconic (sawiridda dots, number lines, arrays). Witzel, Mercer & Miller (2003) waxay heleen in farqigaasi yahay meesha ay bartayaal badani ku dhacaan. Had iyo jeer ku dar tallaabada sawirka.",
      "letting_students_always_work_alone": "Ardayda oggolaanshaha inay had iyo jeer keligood shaqeeyaan",
      "manipulative_work_without_talk_is_half": "Shaqada manipulative HADAL la'aan waa kala badhka qiimaheeda. Lammaanee ardayda; ka doon inay afka ku sheegaan waxay samaynayaan. Afka ku sheegistu WAA tallaabada xoojinta ee falka ka wareejisa \"faruhu way yaqaanaan\" ilaa \"madaxu wuu yaqaan.\"",
      "confusing_speed_with_understanding": "Isku qasidda xawaaraha iyo fahamka",
      "timed_fact_fluency_drills_can_make_stu": "Drills fact-fluency oo waqti leh waxay ardayda ka dhigi karaan kuwo ku dhaqso badan procedures aanay fahmin (eeg cilmi-baarista \"math anxiety\": Boaler 2014). Shaqada manipulative ee gaabis ah MAAHA mid ka hooseeya shaqada warqadda ee degdegga ah K-3.",
      "mismatching_manipulative_to_standard": "Is-waafaqid la'aanta manipulative iyo standard",
      "don_t_use_the_abacus_to_teach_fraction": "Ha isticmaalin abacus si aad u barto fractions. Ha isticmaalin pattern blocks si aad u barto place value. Khariidadda Curriculum waxay muujinaysaa manipulative-ka wax ka qabta CCSS-kee — halkaas ka bilow.",
      "praising_effort_but_not_strategy": "Ammaanta dadaalka laakiin ma aha strategy",
      "saying_great_job_rewards_completion_sa": "Odhaahda \"shaqo wanaagsan!\" waxay abaalmarisaa dhammaystirka. Odhaahda \"Waxaan arkay inaad isku daydayay 3 trapezoids ka hor intaadan u beddelin 6 triangles — maxaa kaa dhigay inaad beddesho?\" waxay abaalmarisaa fikirka. Noqo mid gaar ah.",
      "ignoring_student_invented_strategies": "Iska indhatirka strategies ay ardaydu hal-abuureen",
      "a_student_who_shows_8_5_as_9_4_because": "Arday muujiya 8 + 5 sida \"9 + 4\" (sababtoo ah wuxuu 1 ka qaaday 5 oo marka hore ku daray 8) wuxuu hal-abuuray strategy make-ten. Soo bandhig; magacaw; bar fasalka inay isku dayaan. Habka buugga maaha habka kaliya ee saxda ah.",
      "using_too_many_manipulatives_at_once": "Isticmaalka manipulatives aad u badan hal mar",
      "a_table_covered_in_4_different_manipul": "Miis ay ka buuxaan 4 manipulatives oo kala duwan waa dariiqa jahwareerka, maaha differentiation. Dooro MID cashar kasta. 11-ka kale ee qalabkan ku jira way fiican yihiin — casharro kale.",
      "forgetting_to_ask_why": "Iloowga in la weydiiyo \"maxay?\"",
      "students_will_arrange_counters_correct": "Ardaydu waxay counters u habayn doonaan si sax ah sababtoo ah waxay xafideen tallaabooyinka, iyagoon fahmin macnaha. \"Maxaad 1 u gelisay column-ka toban?\" waa inuu noqdaa su'aashaada aad ugu badan weydiiso.",
      "cleaning_up_too_quickly": "Nadiifinta degdegga ah",
      "a_built_construction_is_a_powerful_art": "Dhisme la dhisay waa shay awood leh — miiska ku dhaaf inta fasalku ka hadlayo. Ku kaydi Maktabadda haddii aad berri u baahan tahay. Ardayda ha ka dhigin inay burburiyaan dhisme adkaan ku helay si loo \"diyaar u noqdo maadada xigta.\"",
      "asking_only_convergent_questions": "Weydiinta su'aalaha convergent oo kaliya",
      "what_is_4_3_has_one_answer_convergent_": "\"Waa maxay 4 + 3?\" wuxuu leeyahay hal jawaab (convergent). \"I tus 7 saddex hab oo kala duwan\" wuxuu leeyahay badan (divergent). Prompts divergent waxay muujiyaan sida ardaydu u fikiraan — taas oo ah assessment-ka muhiimka ah.",
      "about_math_manipulatives": "Ku Saabsan Qalabka Xisaabta",
      "a_virtual_kit_of_12_classic_k_5_math_m": "Kit virtual ah oo 12 manipulatives xisaabeed oo dhaqameed oo K-5 ah, iyo scaffold CRA progression, ",
      "a_challenge_bank_a_ccss_standards_brow": "bangi tartan, CCSS standards browser, maktabad kaarar hawleed oo la daabici karo, iyo ",
      "a_teacher_dashboard_with_progress_expo": "dashboard macallin leh dhoofinta horumarka.",
      "built_as_part_of": "Waxaa loo dhisay qayb ka mid ah ",
      "an_open_source_learning_platform_for_k": ", madal waxbarasho open-source ah oo loogu talagalay fasallada K-12. ",
