      "warm_lo_fi_keys": "Warm lo-fi keys",
      "barry_harris_1929_2021_codified_bebop_": "Barry Harris (1929-2021) wuxuu habeeyay harmony-ga bebop. Nidaamkiisu wuxuu isticmaalaa 6th chords halkii 7ths, wuxuuna ku daraa diminished passing chords inta u dhaxaysa darajooyinka scale si loo hago codka si siman.",
      "ii_v_i_jazz": "ii-V-I (Jazz)",
      "12_bar_blues": "12-Bar Blues",
      "vi_iv_i_v_emo_alt": "vi-IV-I-V (Emo/Alt)",
      "1st_overtone": "Overtone 1aad",
      "2nd_overtone": "Overtone 2aad",
      "3rd_overtone": "Overtone 3aad",
      "4th_overtone": "Overtone 4aad",
      "5th_overtone": "Overtone 5aad",
      "6th_overtone": "Overtone 6aad",
      "7th_overtone": "Overtone 7aad",
      "attack_time_to_reach_full_volume_decay": "Attack: waqtiga la gaaro volume-ka buuxa. Decay: waqtiga la hoos u dhaco sustain. Sustain: heerka volume-ka la hayo. Release: waqtiga uu ka baabbo'o kadib marka key la sii daayo.",
      "a_scale_is_an_ordered_set_of_pitches_m": "Scale waa ururka pitches oo la habeeyay. Modes waa wareega scale oo ka bilaabma darajooyin kala duwan. Mid kastaa wuxuu abuuraa dareen shucuureed oo kala duwan.",
      "chords_are_built_by_stacking_intervals": "Chords waxaa la dhisaa iyadoo la kaydsanayo intervals (3rds). Major wuxuu isticmaalaa major 3rd + minor 3rd. Minor wuu rogaa. Extended chords waxay ku daraan 7ths, 9ths, iyo wixii ka badan.",
      "kicks_use_a_sine_oscillator_with_a_pit": "Kicks waxay isticmaalaan sine oscillator oo leh pitch sweep. Snares waxay isku daraan noise (la sifeeyay) + tone body. Hi-hats waxay isticmaalaan high-pass filtered noise bursts.",
      "4_4_4_quarter_note_beats_per_bar_most_": "4/4 = 4 quarter-note beats bar kasta (kan ugu badan). 3/4 = dareenka waltz. 6/8 = compound duple. 5/4 iyo 7/8 waxay abuuraan grooves aan sinnayn, ajanabi ah.",
      "keys_arranged_by_ascending_5ths_clockw": "Keys waxaa loo habeeyay 5ths kor u kaca oo saacad-raac ah. Keys deriska ah waxay wadaagaan 6 ka mid ah 7 notes. U socodka saacad-raac wuxuu ku daraa sharps; lidka saacadda wuxuu ku daraa flats.",
      "every_musical_sound_contains_overtones": "Cod kasta oo muusiko ah wuxuu ka kooban yahay overtones ka sarreeya fundamental. Xooggooda isku xiran ayaa go'aamiya timbre — sababtaas ayaa turumbo uga duwan yahay flute pitch isku mid ah.",
      "an_interval_is_the_distance_between_tw": "Interval waa masaafada u dhaxaysa laba pitches, oo lagu cabbiro semitones. Frequency ratio ayaa go'aamiya consonance (ratios fudud sida 3:2 way jilicsan yihiin).",
      "plays_chord_notes_one_at_a_time_in_seq": "Waxay ciyaartaa notes chord mid mid isku xigxig. Kor = hoos ilaa kor, Hoos = kor ilaa hoos. Waxay abuurtaa patterns socda oo ka yimaada chords taagan.",
      "a_filter_removes_frequencies_above_low": "Filter wuxuu saaraa frequencies ka sarreeya (lowpass), ka hooseeya (highpass), ama agagaarka (bandpass) cutoff frequency. Resonance (Q) wuxuu kordhiyaa frequencies u dhow cutoff, isagoo abuuraya peak.",
      "tremolo_periodic_volume_changes_amplit": "Tremolo: isbeddel volume xilliyeed (amplitude modulation). Vibrato: isbeddel pitch xilliyeed (frequency modulation). Labadaba waxaa maamula LFO (Low Frequency Oscillator).",
      "discovered_in_1983_a_noise_burst_feeds": "Waxaa la ogaaday 1983. Noise burst wuxuu galaa delay line aad u gaaban oo feedback leh. Delay time ayaa go'aamiya pitch. Filter ku jira feedback loop wuxuu maamulaa iftiinka iyo decay. Wuxuu si dabiici ah u ku ekaadaa plucked strings.",
      "the_sequencer_is_a_composition_tool_ea": "Sequencer waa qalab curinta. Step kasta wuxuu matalaa subdivision beat. Safka melody wuxuu dejiyaa pitched notes, drums waxay ku daraan rhythm. Musical notation wuxuu muujiyaa waxaad abuurto.",
      "notes_on_lines_and_spaces_represent_pi": "Notes ku yaal xariiqyada iyo meelaha bannaan waxay matalaan pitches. Muddada waxaa muujiya qaabka note: whole (○), half (𝅗𝅥), quarter (♩), eighth (♪). Staff wuxuu leeyahay 5 xariiq.",
