      "supersaw_controls": "⚡ SuperSaw Controls",
      "supersaw_unison": "SuperSaw / Unison",
      "supersaw_stacks_multiple_sawtooth_osci": "SuperSaw wuxuu isku kaydiyaa sawtooth oscillators badan oo si yar loo detune-gareeyay midba midka kale. Tani waxay abuurtaa cod weyn, ballaadhan, dhalaalaya — calaamada EDM, trance, iyo pop casri ah. Voices badan = ka qaro weyn laakiin isticmaala CPU badan. Detuning wuxuu maamulaa inta ay voices ka fog yihiin tuning-ka — detune badan = ballaadhan/sida chorus badan, yar = adag/diiraddan.",
