      "arpeggiator_gate": "Gate ee arpeggiator",
      "an_arpeggiator_plays_the_notes_of_a_ch": "🔬 Arpeggiator wuxuu ciyaaraa notes chord mid mid isku xigxig. \"Kor\" wuxuu u socdaa hoos ilaa kor, isagoo abuuraya tamar kor u kacaysa. \"Hoos\" wuu hoos u dhacaa dareenka biyo-dhac. Xawaaraha wuxuu maamulaa xawaaraha (yar = degdeg). Gate wuxuu maamulaa inta ay note kasta dhawaaqdo (100% = legato, 10% = staccato). Isku day xawaare=100ms + 4 octaves + up pattern classic trance arp!",
      "live_mic_effects_lab": "🎤 Live Mic Effects Lab",
      "sing_speak_or_play_an_instrument_hear_": "Hees, hadal, ama cir aalad — dhageyso effects wakhtiga dhabta ah!",
      "monitor_hear_yourself_use_headphones": "🔊 Monitor (dhageyso naftaada — isticmaal headphones!)",
      "microphone_monitor_volume": "Volume monitor microphone",
      "how_effects_change_sound_waves": "🔬 Sida Effects U Bedelaan Sound Waves",
      "filter_cutoff": "Filter (Cutoff)",
      "removes_frequencies_above_lowpass_or_b": "Wuxuu saaraa frequencies ka sarreeya (lowpass) ama ka hooseeya (highpass) threshold. Sida gacan lagu daboolo afka — frequencies sarreeya way baabba'aan, codku wuxuu noqdaa mid \"madow\" oo dheeraad ah.",
      "delay": "Delay",
      "creates_echoes_by_copying_the_signal_a": "Wuxuu abuuraa dhawaaqyo iyadoo la koobbiyayo signal-ka oo dib loo ciyaaro muddo gaaban ka dib. Feedback wuxuu maamulaa tirada dhawaaqyada dib u soo noqda.",
      "reverb_2": "Reverb",
      "simulates_room_acoustics_by_creating_t": "Wuxuu ku ekaadaa acoustics-ka qol iyadoo la abuurayo kumanaan dhawaaq yaryar oo isku dhex jira. Qol yar = reverb gaaban, kaniisad weyn = reverb dheer.",
      "distortion": "Distortion",
      "clips_the_waveform_peaks_turning_smoot": "Wuxuu jaraa waveform peaks, isagoo u rogaya sine waves jilicsan qaabab adag, geesood leh. Tani waxay ku dartaa harmonics cusub oo aan ku jirin codka asalka ah.",
      "chorus": "Chorus",
      "duplicates_the_signal_with_a_slight_co": "Wuxuu koobbiyaa signal-ka delay yar oo si joogto ah u bedelaya. Tani waxay ku ekaataa voices/aalado badan oo isku ciyaaraya iyagoo aan si buuxda isu waafaqsanayn.",
      "tremolo": "Tremolo",
      "rapidly_varies_the_volume_up_and_down_": "Wuxuu si degdeg ah u bedelaa volume-ka kor iyo hoos, isagoo abuuraya saameyn garaacaya. Waa caan guitar-ka surf iyo muusikada organ.",
      "use_headphones_when_monitoring_to_avoi": "Isticmaal headphones marka aad monitor-gareyneyso si aad uga fogaato feedback loops! Mic-ku wuxuu maraa dhammaan effects-ka kore (filter, delay, reverb, iwm.) — hagaaji si aad u maqasho sida mid kastaa u beddelo codkaaga ama aaladdaada.",
      "connect_your_microphone_to_run_your_vo": "Ku xir microphone-kaaga si aad codkaaga ama aaladdaada uga socodsiiso effects chain wakhtiga dhabta ah.",
      "see_your_voice_as_a_waveform_frequency": "Arag codkaaga oo ah waveform + frequency spectrum. Dhageyso sida filter, delay, reverb, distortion, iyo chorus u beddelaan sound waves jir ahaan.",
      "xy_performance_pad": "🎯 XY Performance Pad",
      "touch_drag_x_pitch_y_filter_effect": "Taabo & jiid — X = pitch, Y = filter/effect",
      "xy_pad_performance": "XY Pad Performance",
      "the_xy_pad_maps_your_finger_mouse_posi": "XY pad wuxuu khariidad ka sameeyaa meesha farta/mouse-kaaga wuxuuna u xiraa musical parameters wakhtiga dhabta ah. X axis wuxuu maamulaa pitch (bidix = hoose, midig = sare). Y axis wuxuu maamulaa filter cutoff frequency (kor = iftiin, hoos = madow). Tani waxay la mid tahay aalado sida Korg Kaoss Pad, oo kacaan ku sameeyay live electronic music performance iyadoo 2D gestures loo rogay cod.",
      "xy_performance_pad_left_right_is_pitch": "XY performance pad. Bidix–midig waa pitch, kor–hoos waa filter brightness. Isticmaal arrow keys si aad u dhaqaaqdo oo aad u ciyaartid note; taabo Escape ama Space si aad u joojiso.",
