      "chord_progressions_create_emotional_jo": "Chord progressions waxay abuuraan safarro shucuureed. Chord I (tonic) wuxuu u dareemaa sida 'guri.' Chord V (dominant) wuxuu abuuraa xiisad rabta inay ku noqoto I. Chord vi (relative minor) wuxuu ku daraa murugo ama qoto. Chord IV (subdominant) si tartiib ah ayuu uga fogaadaa guriga. Waxaa la qiyaasaa in I-V-vi-IV progression uu ka muuqdo in ka badan 70% heesaha pop sababtoo ah wuxuu si fiican u dheellitiraa shucuurahan.",
