      "e_1_means_object_barely_bound_paraboli": "e → 1 waxay ka dhigan tahay in shaygu si dirqi ah u xidhan yahay (parabolig) ama uusan xidhnayn (hayperbolig) — wuxuu noqon karaa mid xiddigaha dhex mara.",
      "kepler_inquiry_orbital_mechanics_sandb": "🔬 Baadhitaanka Kepler — Goobta Tijaabada ee Farsamada Wareegyada",
