      "does_eccentricity_change_orbital_perio": "Eksentrisiti miyuu beddelaa MUDDADA wareegga? Isku day e=0 iyo e=0.5 isla a.",
      "halley_s_comet_has_a_17_8_au_e_0_97_wh": "Xiddig-dabeedka Halley wuxuu leeyahay a=17.8 AU, e=0.97. Maxay taasi ka dhigan tahay muddadiisa — iyo inta jeer ee uu perihelion-ka booqdo?",
