      "i_can_explain_why_this_a_e_m_combinati": "Waan sharxi karaa sababta isku-darka a/e/M uu u dhaliyo nooca wareeggan.",
      "explain_in_your_own_words": "Ku sharrax ereyadaada...",
      "inquiry_widget_no_score_no_reveal_no_a": "Aalad baadhis — dhibco ma jiraan, jawaab la muujinayo ma jirto, liis jawaabo ahna lama soo saaro. T = √(a³/M) sida Kepler III, M waa cuf-qorraxeed, a waa AU, T waa sanado. Vis-viva ayaa loo isticmaalaa v-ga perihelion-ka / aphelion-ka.",
      "full_orrery_animated_solar_system": "Orrery buuxa — nidaam qorraxeed oo dhaqaaqaya",
      "all_8_planets_to_scale_size_orbit_watc": "Dhammaan 8-da meere oo cabbir saxan ku jira (cabbirka + wareegga). Daawo Mercury oo Qorraxda ku wareega ~4 jeer sannad-Dhuleedkiiba. Meerayaasha guduhu way isku cufan yihiin; kuwa dibaddu waxay maraan wareegyo waaweyn.",
      "kepler_i_orbits_are_ellipses": "Kepler I — wareegyadu waa beydad",
      "every_planet_orbits_in_an_ellipse_with": "Meere kastaa wuxuu ku wareegaa beyd Qorraxdu ku taal mid ka mid ah diiradaha. Diiradda kale waa meel bannaan. Wareegga Dhulku si dirqi ah ayuu u eksentrig yahay (e ≈ 0.017).",
      "kepler_ii_equal_areas_in_equal_times": "Kepler II — bedad siman waqtiyo siman",
      "a_line_from_planet_to_sun_sweeps_equal": "Khad meeraha ilaa Qorraxda ah wuxuu maraa bedad siman waqtiyo siman — taasoo macnaheedu yahay in meerayaashu ay si DHAKHSO ah u socdaan marka ay Qorraxda u dhow yihiin (perihelion) oo ay si GAABIS ah u socdaan marka ay ka fog yihiin (aphelion).",
      "kepler_iii_period_semi_major_axis": "Kepler III — muddada² ∝ nus-dhidibka-weyn³",
      "t_a_when_t_is_in_years_and_a_is_in_au_": "T² = a³ marka T uu yahay sanado, a-na uu yahay AU. Dhulka T=1, a=1 waxay xisaabta ka dhigaan mid si qurux badan u nadiif ah. Labanlaabidda cabbirka wareegga waxay muddada ku dhufataa ~2.83.",
      "workshop_build_your_own_orbit": "Goobta shaqada — dhis wareeggaaga",
      "set_semi_major_axis_eccentricity_the_o": "Deji nus-dhidibka weyn + eksentrisiti; orrery-gu wuxuu wareegga ku muujiyaa waqti dhab ah. Isku day e=0.9 — taasi waa dhulka xiddig-dabeedyada. Isku day e=0 — goobo dhammaystiran.",
      "hohmann_transfers_actual_rocket_math": "Wareejinta Hohmann — xisaabta gantaalaha ee dhabta ah",
      "the_minimum_energy_way_to_travel_betwe": "Habka tamarta ugu yar ee lagu safro laba wareeg oo goobo ah. Laba gubasho: ka bax wareegga gudaha perihelion-ka wareejinta, kuna soo gaadh wareegga dibadda aphelion-ka.",
      "challenges_apply_kepler_s_laws": "Caqabado — ku dabbaq sharciyada Kepler",
      "multi_step_problems_predict_periods_fr": "Dhibaatooyin tallaabo badan leh: saadaali muddooyinka adigoo ka duulaya nus-dhidibka weyn, kala saar xawaaraha perihelion-ka iyo aphelion-ka, xisaabi Δv-ga wareegga wareejinta. Heerka AP Physics 1 + 2.",
      "true_false_concept_check": "Run / Been — hubinta fikradda",
      "quick_discrimination_quiz_on_common_ke": "Imtixaan degdeg ah oo kala-soocid ah oo ku saabsan qalad-fahamyada caadiga ah ee Kepler. Wuxuu bartilmaameedsanayaa khuraafaadka wareegyada ('dhaw = gaabis,' 'wareegyadu waa goobooyin,' 'dhammaan wareegyadu isku jiho ayay u socdaan').",
      "kepler_inquiry_orbital_mechanics_sandb_2": "Baadhitaanka Kepler — goobta tijaabada ee farsamada wareegyada",
      "move_semi_major_axis_eccentricity_and_": "Dhaqaaji nus-dhidibka weyn, eksentrisiti, iyo cufka jirka bartamaha. Saadaali nooca wareegga — goobo, beydsan, eksentrig, xiddig-dabeed, parabolig. Dhibco ma jiraan, jawaab la muujinayaana ma jirto.",
