      "these_scarps_can_be_hundreds_of_km_lon": "Gebiyadan waxay noqon karaan boqollaal km dherer ah iyo in ka badan 1 km sarajoog ah.",
      "highest_mountain_on_venus_at_11_km_tal": "Buurta ugu dheer Venus oo 11 km ah — way ka dheer tahay Everest.",
      "the_summit_is_coated_with_a_metallic_s": "Dhaladda waxaa daboolay 'baraf' bir ah — saynisyahannadu waxay u maleynayaan inay u badan tahay rasaas sulfayd iyo bismuth sulfayd.",
      "flat_topped_volcanic_domes_unique_to_v": "Qubbado foolkaano ah oo korkoodu siman yahay oo Venus u gaar ah, ilaa 65 km ballac ah.",
      "extremely_viscous_lava_oozed_out_and_s": "Laafo aad u culus ayaa soo daadatay oo u fidday sida cajiin canjeero oo qaro weyn.",
      "soviet_lander_that_survived_127_minute": "Degiye Soofiyeeti ah oo dusha ku noolaaday 127 daqiiqo sannadkii 1982.",
      "venera_13_took_the_first_color_photos_": "Venera 13 wuxuu qaaday sawirradii midabka lahaa ee ugu horreeyay ee dusha Venus ka hor inta uusan kulaylka iyo cadaadisku hawlgalkiisa dhammayn.",
      "mariana_trench": "Bohosha Mariana",
      "deepest_point_on_earth_at_11_034_m_dee": "Barta ugu qoto dheer Dhulka oo qiyaastii 10,935 m ah — way ka qoto dheer tahay intii Everest dheer yahay.",
      "more_people_have_walked_on_the_moon_th": "Dad ka badan ayaa Dayaxa ku dul socday marka loo eego kuwa tagay hoosta Bohosha Mariana.",
      "hydrothermal_vent_field": "Beerta Daloollada Kulaylka Biyaha",
      "superheated_water_erupts_at_400_c_supp": "Biyo aad u kulul ayaa ka qarxa 400°C, iyagoo nolol taageeraya iftiin qorrax la'aan.",
      "tube_worms_here_can_grow_to_2_4m_and_l": "Gooryaanka tuubbada ee halkani waxay gaadhi karaan 2.4m waxayna noolaan karaan 250+ sano iyagoo isticmaalaya kimo-samaynta — iftiin qorrax looma baahna!",
      "coral_reef_colony": "Deegaanka Seebka Murjaanka",
      "a_living_reef_system_teeming_with_biod": "Nidaam seeb nool oo ay ka buuxaan noolayaal kala duwan.",
      "coral_reefs_support_25_of_all_marine_s_2": "Seebabka murjaanka waxay taageeraan 25% noocyada nool ee badda oo dhan inkastoo ay daboolaan wax ka yar 1% sagxadda badda.",
      "shipwreck": "Markab Burburay",
      "a_sunken_vessel_colonized_by_marine_li": "Markab quusay oo noolaha badda degeen — seeb macmal ah.",
      "there_are_an_estimated_3_million_shipw": "Waxaa lagu qiyaasaa 3 milyan oo markab burburay oo sagxadda badda ku yaal adduunka oo dhan. Kuwo badan waxay noqdaan deegaanno nool oo barwaaqo ah.",
      "olympus_mons_is_so_wide_624_km_that_st": "Olympus Mons aad buu u ballaadhan yahay (624 km) oo haddii aad cidhifkiisa taagan tahay, dhaladda ma arki kartid — wuxuu ka leexdaa cirifka aragga.",
      "it_would_stretch_from_new_york_to_los_": "Wuxuu ka fidi lahaa New York ilaa Los Angeles wuxuuna 5 jeer ka qoto dheer yahay Grand Canyon.",
      "if_all_of_mars_s_polar_ice_melted_it_c": "Haddii dhammaan barafka cirifyada Mars uu dhalaalo, wuxuu meeraha oo dhan ku dabooli karaa 11 mitir oo biyo ah.",
      "jezero_crater_where_nasa_s_rover_searc": "Godka Jezero — halka roverka NASA uu ka raadinayo calaamado nolol hore.",
      "perseverance_arrived_feb_2021_and_has_": "Perseverance wuxuu yimid Feb 2021 wuxuuna wadey 28+ km, isagoo ururinaya muunado dhagax ah oo mustaqbalka Dhulka loo soo celin doono.",
      "an_anticyclonic_storm_raging_for_350_y": "Duufaan lidka-dawdawga ah oo 350+ sano socotay, oo ka weyn Dhulka.",
      "wind_speeds_at_the_edge_reach_680_km_h": "Xawaaraha dabaysha cidhifka ayaa gaadha 680 km/h — laban jibbaar xawaaraha duufaanka ugu xoogga badan Dhulka.",
      "upper_cloud_layer_made_of_frozen_ammon": "Lakabka daruuraha sare oo ka samaysan kirishtaal amoonyaak barafoobay oo -145°C ah.",
      "below_this_layer_are_ammonium_hydrosul": "Lakabkan hoostiisa waxaa yaal daruuro amooniyam haydrosulfayd ah, kuwaas hoostoodana daruuro biyo ah. Jupiter wuxuu leeyahay cimilo 3 lakab qoto dheer.",
      "zones_between_cloud_bands_where_convec": "Aagag u dhexeeya xariggii daruuraha oo kacsanaantu ka wado duufaanno hillaac oo waaweyn.",
      "jupiter_s_lightning_is_10x_more_powerf": "Hillaaca Jupiter waa 10 jeer ka xoog badan kan Dhulka wuxuuna inta badan ka dhacaa cirifyada iyo daruuraha qoto dheer.",
      "deep_below_the_clouds_pressure_turns_h": "Si qoto dheer daruuraha hoostooda, cadaadisku wuxuu haydarojiinta u rogaa bir dareere ah.",
      "this_metallic_hydrogen_ocean_generates": "Baddan haydarojiinta birta ahi waxay abuurtaa beerta birlabeed ee Jupiter — 20,000 jeer ka xoog badan tan Dhulka.",
      "a_persistent_hexagonal_cloud_pattern_a": "Qaab daruur lix-geesle ah oo joogto ah oo ku yaal cirifka woqooyi ee Saturn.",
      "each_side_of_the_hexagon_is_about_14_5": "Dhinac kasta oo lix-geesleha ah dhererkiisu waa qiyaastii 14,500 km — way ka ballaadhan tahay dhexroorka Dhulka.",
      "area_where_saturn_s_rings_cast_shadows": "Aagga giraamaha Saturn ay hoos ku tuuraan daruuraha sare.",
      "saturn_s_rings_are_only_about_10_m_thi": "Giraamaha Saturn qaradoodu waa qiyaastii 10 m oo kaliya in kastoo ay 282,000 km ballac yihiin — saami ahaan way ka khafiifsan yihiin daabad mandiil.",
      "titan_has_lakes_of_liquid_methane_and_": "Titan wuxuu leeyahay harooyin meetheyn dareere ah iyo jawi Dhulka ka qaro weyn — dayaxa kaliya ee leh jawi la sheegi karo.",
      "at_8_000_km_depth_extreme_pressure_cru": "Moolka 8,000 km, cadaadiska daran ayaa kaarboonka u burburiya dheeman.",
      "these_diamonds_may_be_as_large_as_mill": "Dheemankan waxaa laga yaabaa inay le'eg yihiin malaayiin karaat waxayna hoos u da'aan si ay xudunta ugu samaystaan lakab dheeman ah.",
      "uranus_s_magnetic_field_is_tilted_59_f": "Beerta birlabeed ee Uranus waxay ka janjeedhsan tahay 59° dhidibka wareeggiisa.",
      "combined_with_the_98_axial_tilt_uranus": "Marka lagu daro janjeedhka dhidibeed ee 98°, birlab-wareegga Uranus si qas ah ayuu hawada ugu rogrogmaa.",
      "faint_methane_cloud_bands_where_wind_p": "Xarig daruur meetheyn ah oo khafiif ah halka qaababka dabayshu jihada beddelaan.",
      "uranus_appears_featureless_but_hubble_": "Uranus wuxuu u muuqdaa mid aan astaan lahayn laakiin Hubble wuxuu muujiyay nidaamyo daruur oo adag oo ku socda 900 km/h.",
      "a_massive_storm_system_similar_to_jupi": "Nidaam duufaan weyn oo la mid ah Barta Cas ee Weyn ee Jupiter.",
      "unlike_jupiter_s_spot_neptune_s_dark_s": "Si ka duwan barta Jupiter, barooyinka madow ee Neptune way muuqdaan wayna baabba'aan sannado gudahood — meerahu si lala yaabo leh ayuu u firfircoon yahay.",
      "equatorial_winds_reaching_2_100_km_h_f": "Dabaylo dhulbaraha ah oo gaadhaya 2,100 km/h — dhawaaqa ka dheereeya.",
      "neptune_generates_more_heat_than_it_re": "Neptune wuxuu soo saaraa kulayl ka badan kan uu Qorraxda ka helo, isagoo dabaylahan daran ka wada tamar gudaha ah.",
      "the_path_of_triton_the_only_large_moon": "Wadada Triton — dayaxa weyn ee kaliya ee gadaal u wareega.",
      "triton_is_likely_a_captured_kuiper_bel": "Triton waxay u badan tahay inuu yahay shay laga qabtay Suunka Kuiper. Ilo-kacsantiisa nitrojiinku waxay tuuraan qiiq 8 km sarajoog ah.",
      "the_famous_heart_shaped_glacier_made_o": "Baraf-socodka caanka ah ee qaabka wadnaha leh oo ka samaysan baraf nitrojiin iyo kaarboon monoksayd ah.",
      "the_left_lobe_sputnik_planitia_is_a_va": "Qaybta bidix (Sputnik Planitia) waa bannaan baraf weyn oo leh unugyo kacsanaan ah oo si tartiib ah barafka u wada.",
      "mountains_of_water_ice_rising_2_3_km_a": "Buuro baraf biyo ah oo 2–3 km ka sarreeya bannaannada nitrojiinka.",
      "because_water_ice_is_less_dense_than_n": "Sababtoo ah barafka biyuhu wuu ka cufnaan yar yahay barafka nitrojiinka heerkulka Pluto, buurahani dhab ahaan way dabbaalaan.",
      "tholins_are_complex_organic_molecules__2": "Tholins waa unugyo organic ah oo adag oo samaysma marka meetheynka shucaac lagu shubo — waxay Pluto siiyaan midabkiisa casaan-bunni ah.",
