      "mars_atmosphere_is_100_thinner_than_ea": "Jawiga Mars waa 100× ka khafiifsan kan Dhulka. Ka-koobnaanta: 95% CO₂. Si aad Mars ugu neefsato waxaad u baahan lahayd ogsijiin + cadaadis 100× ka badan. Nitrojiin bacrimin ah ku dhawaad ma jirto.",
      "black_hole_vocabulary": "🕳 Erayada Godka Madow",
      "10_essential_black_hole_terms_event_ho": "10 eray oo lagama maarmaan ah oo godka madow: cirifka dhacdada, barta keliya, siigaysanaanta, shucaaca Hawking.",
      "event_horizon_telescope_captured_first": "Telescope-ka Cirifka Dhacdada wuxuu qaaday sawirkii ugu horreeyay ee godka madow ee M87* (2019) + Sgr A* (2022). Giraanta oranji ah = iftiin ku qalloocay goobo madow oo iftiinku aanu ka baxsan karin.",
      "auroras_across_solar_system": "🌈 Iftiinka Cirifka Nidaamka Qorraxda Oo Dhan",
      "five_planets_have_auroras_earth_s_is_g": "Shan meere ayaa leh iftiin cirifeed. Kan Dhulku waa cagaar/cas, kan Jupiter waa kan ugu xoogga badan, kan Mars-na waa firdhsan.",
      "earth_aurora": "Iftiinka cirifka ee Dhulka",
      "green_oxygen_red_atomic_o_blue_nitroge": "Cagaar (ogsijiin) + cas (O atam ah) + buluug (nitrojiin). Sida ugu fiican waxaa lagu arkaa cirifyada birlabeedka agtooda.",
      "jupiter_aurora": "Iftiinka cirifka ee Jupiter",
      "most_powerful_in_solar_system_driven_b": "Kan ugu xoogga badan nidaamka qorraxda. Waxaa wada foolkaanaha Io + beerta birlabeed ee Jupiter. Iftiin cirifeed UV ah oo joogto ah.",
      "saturn_aurora": "Iftiinka cirifka ee Saturn",
      "powered_by_solar_wind_less_colorful_th": "Waxaa shidaal u ah dabaysha qorraxda. Midab ka yar kan Dhulka laakiin aad buu u weyn yahay. Wuxuu socdaa maalmo isku xigta.",
