      "jwst_limit": "Xadka JWST",
      "magnitudes_count_backward_smaller_brig": "Heerarka iftiinka GADAAL ayaa loo tiriyaa: ka yar = ka dhalaalaya. Tallaabo kasta oo 5 ah = 100× ka dhalaalaya. Hipparchus ayaa 130 BCE curiyay. Qorraxda: -26.7. JWST wuxuu arkaa ilaa heerka 34. Gaadhka: 100^((34-(-26))/5) ≈ 10^24 jeer ka liita Qorraxda.",
      "celestial_coordinate_systems": "🧭 Nidaamyada Isku-xidhyada Cirka",
