      "equatorial_ra_dec": "Dhulbaraheed (RA/Dec)",
      "star_fixed_coordinates_right_ascension": "Isku-xidhyo xiddigaha ku dhegan. Kor-u-kaca midig (h:m:s) + Janjeedhka (°). Waxaa loo isticmaalaa buugaagta cirbixiyeenka.",
