      "galactic": "Galaktig",
      "centered_on_milky_way_plane_used_for_g": "Waxaa udub dhexaad u ah diyaaradda Jidka Caanaha. Waxaa loo isticmaalaa daraasadaha galaxyada.",
      "astronomers_use_multiple_coordinate_sy": "Cirbixiyeennadu waxay isticmaalaan nidaamyo isku-xidhyo badan. Dhulbaraheedku waa mid guud + waxyaabuhu waxay hayaan isla isku-xidhyada inta Dhulku wareegayo. Alt-Az had iyo jeer wuu beddelmaa inta Dhulku wareegayo. Galaktigga ayaa ugu fiican daraasadda dhismaha Jidka Caanaha.",
      "big_numbers_in_astronomy": "🔢 Tirooyinka Waaweyn ee Cirbixiyeenimada",
      "from_1_sun_to_10_22_stars_the_scale_of": "Laga bilaabo 1 Qorrax ilaa 10^22 xiddig. Cabbirka koonku waa mid yaab leh.",
      "astronomy_operates_on_absurd_scales_ho": "Cirbixiyeenimadu waxay ku shaqaysaa cabbirro aan macquul ahayn. 'Immisa xiddig?' — ka badan xabbadaha ciidda xeeb kasta oo Dhulka ah. 'Immisa jir?' — 13.8 bilyan oo sano. Haddana tirooyin qaar (uumi-bixidda godka madow) ayaa xitaa ka sii weyn.",
      "space_debris_tracker": "🛰 Raad-raaca Qashinka Hawada",
      "36_500_objects_orbit_earth_at_various_": "36,500 shay ayaa Dhulka ku wareega sarajoogyo kala duwan. Dhaqaaji siiliyaha sarajoogga si aad u aragto waxa halkaas jooga.",
      "altitude_3": "Sarajoogga",
      "36_500_tracked_objects_millions_of_fra": "36,500 shay oo la raad-raaco + malaayiin jajab ayaa Dhulka ku wareega. Khatarta Kessler Syndrome: isku dhacyo isdaba socda ayaa hawada ka dhigaya mid aan la isticmaali karin. SpaceX Starlink waxay leedahay 5000+ dayax-gacmeed; waxay qorsheynayaan kuwo badan oo kale.",
      "constellation_mythology": "📜 Sheekooyinka Kooxaha Xiddigaha",
      "every_culture_sees_stories_in_the_star": "Dhaqan kastaa wuxuu xiddigaha ka arkaa sheekooyin. Laga bilaabo halyeeyada Giriigga ilaa Emu-ga Cirka ee dadka asaliga ah ee Australia.",
      "orion_2": "Orion",
