      "next_4": "Xiga →",
      "stories_projected_onto_stars_by_cultur": "Sheekooyin ay dhaqamada adduunka oo dhan xiddigaha saareen. Emu-ga Cirka ee dadka asaliga ah ee Australia wuxuu isticmaalaa daruuraha boodhka ee madow. Hagayaasha Boliineeshiya waxay xiddigaha ku maraan Baasifigga iyagoo xusuusta ku tiirsan. Cirbixiyeenimaduna waa sheeko-sheeg sidoo kale.",
      "exoplanet_detection_methods": "🔍 Habka Lagu Ogaado Meerayaasha Dibadda",
