      "transit_method": "Habka marista",
      "watch_a_star_and_look_for_tiny_brightn": "Daawo xiddig oo raadi hoos-u-dhac yar oo iftiin ah marka meere hortiisa maro. Waxaa isticmaala Kepler + TESS.",
      "radial_velocity": "Xawaaraha gacan-dhexaadeed",
