      "pulsar_timing": "Waqti-cabbiraadda pulsar-ka",
      "variations_in_pulsar_pulses_reveal_orb": "Kala duwanaanshaha garaaca pulsar-ku wuxuu muujiyaa jirar ku wareegaya. Meerayaashii dibadda ee ugu horreeyay sidan ayaa loo helay (1992).",
      "first_exoplanet_around_a_sun_like_star": "Meerihii dibadda ee ugu horreeyay ee ku wareega xiddig qorraxda u eg: 51 Pegasi b (1995). Hadda 6,300+ ayaa la xaqiijiyay. JWST wuxuu meerayaasha dibadda ku samaynayaa spektroskobi jawi — isagoo raadinaya calaamado nololeed.",
      "upcoming_eclipses": "🌙 Madoobaadyada Soo Socda",
      "schedule_of_eclipses_2024_2079_maine_s": "Jadwalka madoobaadyada 2024-2079. Madoobaadka qorraxda ee buuxa ee Maine ku xiga: 2079.",
