      "edwin_hubble_classified_galaxies_in_19": "Edwin Hubble ayaa 1936 galaxyada kala saaray — 'fargeetada duubka Hubble.' Kuwa wareegsan + kuwa beydsan + kuwa aan caadiga ahayn. Galaxyaduhu waxay ku kobcaan isku-darsanaan — Jidka Caanuhu wuxuu ku jiraa bartamaha noloshiisa; isku-darsanaan Andromeda waxaa laga yaabaa inay imaanayso bilyaman sano gudahood (daraasadaha 2025 waxay saadaasha u dhigaan ku dhawaad 50/50).",
      "cosmic_speeds_chart": "⚡ Shaxda Xawaaraha Koonka",
      "from_walking_to_light_speed_log_scale_": "Laga bilaabo socodka ilaa xawaaraha iftiinka (cabbir log ah). Voyager 1 waa shayga dadku sameeyeen ee ugu fog waana mid ka mid ah baarayaasheenna ugu dheereeya, laakiin koonka marka la eego weli waa gaabis.",
      "voyager_1_is_the_fastest_object_humans": "Voyager 1 wuu dheereeyaa marka lagu cabbiro markabyada hawada, hadduuna yahay shayga dadku sameeyeen ee ugu fog, haddana wuxuu weli qaadan lahaa qiyaastii 80,000 sano inuu xiddigga ugu dhow gaadho. Iftiinku isla safarkaas wuxuu ku qaataa 4 sano.",
      "star_forming_region": "✨ Gobolka Samaynta Xiddigaha",
      "watch_stars_form_from_cold_dust_to_hot": "Daawo xiddigaha oo ka samaysmaya boodh qabow ilaa qorraxo kulul. 6 marxaladood oo dhowr milyan oo sano socda.",
      "stars_are_born_in_clusters_from_giant_": "Xiddiguhu waxay ku dhashaan kooxo ka soo jeeda daruuro molekul ah oo waaweyn. Habka guud: dhowr milyan oo sano. Tusaalayaal caan ah: Nebula-ga Orion (M42), Nebula-ga Gorgorka (Tiirarka Abuurka), Nebula-ga Tarantula.",
