      "property": "Sifo",
      "side_by_side_comparison_of_key_planet_": "Isbarbardhig dhinac-dhinac ah oo sifooyinka muhiimka ah ee meerayaasha. Dhulka = saldhigga. Qorraxdu waa qiyaastii 109 jeer dhexroorka Dhulka (in ka badan milyan jeer mugga). Jupiter wuxuu leeyahay 115 dayax oo la yaqaan. Venus si gaabis ah ayay u wareegtaa oo maalinteedu way ka dheer tahay sannadkeeda.",
      "about_this_tool": "🌌 Ku Saabsan Qalabkan",
      "40_visual_interactive_mini_tools_made_": "40+ qalab yaryar oo muuqaal + is-dhexgal ah. Waxaa loo sameeyay ardayda + dadka waaweyn ee xiiseeya.",
      "solar_system_explorer_2": "Sahamiyaha Nidaamka Qorraxda",
      "40_interactive_mini_tools_svg_visualiz": "40+ qalab yaryar oo is-dhexgal ah, muujin SVG ah, iyo jilitaan waxbarasho.",
      "from_a_moon_phase_dial_to_a_black_hole": "Laga bilaabo wareegga marxaladaha dayaxa ilaa muujiyaha godka madow ilaa rooggaha Foucault, qalab kastaa waxaa loo dhisay in fikradaha aan la taaban karin la dareemo + lagu ciyaaro.",
      "built_for_k_12_curious_adults_open_all": "Waxaa loo dhisay K-12 + dadka waaweyn ee xiiseeya. Fur dhammaan qalabka, ama mid kaliya — mid kastaa keligiis wuu shaqeeyaa.",
