      "tonight_sky_observing_guide": "🔭 Hagaha Indha-indheynta Cirka Caawa",
      "10_things_you_can_spot_tonight_with_ju": "10 wax oo aad caawa ku arki karto indhahaaga kaliya ama binokular.",
      "best_naked_eye_observing_dark_site_awa": "Indha-indheynta isha qaawan ee ugu fiican: goob mugdi ah (iftiinka magaalada ka fog), Dayaxa oo cirifka aragga ka hooseeya, indhaha oo la qabsaday (20-30 daq mugdiga). Abbaaro bilaash ah: Stellarium, SkyView, Star Walk waxay kaa caawiyaan aqoonsiga waxaad aragto.",
      "pale_blue_dot": "🌍 Dhibicda Buluugga Khafiifka ah",
      "carl_sagan_s_most_quoted_reflection_a_": "Milicsiga Carl Sagan ee ugu badan ee la soo xigto. Hal pixel oo ka kooban qof kasta oo aan weligeen naqaan.",
      "the_pale_blue_dot": "Dhibicda Buluugga Khafiifka ah",
      "from_this_distant_vantage_point_the_ea": "\"Meeshan fog laga eego, Dhulku waxba xiiso gaar ah uma laha. Laakiin annaga, way ka duwan tahay. Mar kale ka fiirso dhibicdaas. Taasi waa halkan. Taasi waa guriga. Taasi waa innaga. Dusheeda ayaa qof kasta oo aad jeceshahay, qof kasta oo aad taqaan, qof kasta oo aad maqashay, aadmi kasta oo weligiis jiray, ku noolaayeen noloshooda.\"",
      "carl_sagan_pale_blue_dot_1994": "— Carl Sagan, Pale Blue Dot (1994)",
      "voyager_1_took_this_photo_of_earth_fro": "Voyager 1 wuxuu sawirkan Dhulka ka qaaday 6 bilyan km u jira Feb 14, 1990 — codsi ka yimid Carl Sagan. Dhulku waa hal pixel. Aadmi kasta oo taariikhda ka mid ahi wuxuu ku noolaa pixel-kaas.",
