      "local_astronomy_club": "Naadi cirbixiyeenimo oo deegaanka ah",
      "most_cities_have_one_members_lend_scop": "Magaalooyinka intooda badan mid bay leeyihiin. Xubnuhu telescope-yo way amaahiyaan, wax bay baraan, xaflado xiddigeed bay qabtaan.",
      "dark_site": "Goob mugdi ah",
      "drive_30_min_from_city_lights_maine_is": "U kaxee 30+ daqiiqo iftiinka magaalada. Maine way ka buuxaan. Katahdin Woods and Waters waa hoy cir-mugdi ah oo la shahaadeeyay.",
      "most_important_tool_dark_sky_light_pol": "Qalabka ugu muhiimsan: cir mugdi ah. Wasakhda iftiinku waxay tirtirtaa 90% xiddigaha. Katahdin Woods and Waters NM iyo AMC Maine Woods waa goobo Caalami ah oo Cir-Mugdi ah oo la shahaadeeyay; Acadia iyo Baxter sidoo kale waxay bixiyaan cir mugdi ah oo aad u fiican.",
      "how_stars_die": "⚱ Sida Xiddiguhu u Dhintaan",
      "star_s_fate_depends_on_mass_brown_dwar": "Aayaha xiddiggu wuxuu ku xidhan yahay cufka: xiddig-yare bunni ah, xiddig-yare cad, xiddig nutroon, ama god madow.",
      "how_a_star_dies_depends_almost_entirel": "Sida xiddig u dhinto ku dhawaad gebi ahaanba waxay ku xidhan tahay cufkiisii bilowga. Xadka u dhexeeya xiddigga nutroonka + godka madow lama hubo (xadka Tolman-Oppenheimer-Volkoff ~2-3 M☉ hadhaaga).",
      "cosmic_distance_reference": "📏 Tixraaca Masaafada Koonka",
      "from_1km_to_93_billion_light_years_ref": "Laga bilaabo 1km ilaa 93 bilyan oo sano-iftiineed. Shax tixraac oo cabbirrada koonka.",
      "distances_jump_in_scale_km_to_au_to_ly": "Masaafooyinku cabbir ahaan way boodaan: km ilaa AU ilaa ly ilaa bilyaman ly. Tallaabo kastaa waa ~10,000-100,000× ka weyn. Cirbixiyeenimadu waxay ku nooshahay cabbir log ah.",
      "maine_night_sky_by_season": "🌲 Cirka Habeenkii ee Maine Xilli-Xilli",
      "maine_has_world_class_dark_skies_what_": "Maine waxay leedahay cir mugdi ah oo heer-caalami ah. Waxa la eego xilli kasta.",
      "maine_has_fantastic_dark_skies_especia": "Maine waxay leedahay cir mugdi ah oo cajiib ah — gaar ahaan magaalooyinka woqooyigooda. Katahdin Woods and Waters NM iyo AMC Maine Woods waa goobo Caalami ah oo Cir-Mugdi ah oo la shahaadeeyay; Acadia, Allagash, Baxter, iyo Cobscook sidoo kale aad bay u mugdi wanaagsan yihiin. Habeennada jiilaalku way dhaadheer yihiin wayna saafi yihiin.",
      "space_news_timeline": "📰 Jadwalka Wararka Hawada",
      "major_space_missions_events_2024_2027_": "Hawlgallada hawada ee waaweyn + dhacdooyinka 2024-2027. Waxaan ku nool nahay waqtiyo xiiso leh.",
      "space_exploration_is_in_a_renaissance_": "Sahaminta hawadu waxay ku jirtaa soo-noolaansho. Dalal cusub (Hindiya, Jabbaan, Imaaraadka), shirkado gaar ah oo cusub (SpaceX, Blue Origin), hawlgallo cusub (Europa Clipper, Artemis, JWST). Kor u eeg — oo fiiro gaar ah u yeel.",
      "solar_system_at_a_glance": "📊 Nidaamka Qorraxda Hal Aragti",
      "quick_reference_summary_of_solar_syste": "Kooban tixraac degdeg ah oo waxa ku jira nidaamka qorraxda + qaybinta cufka.",
      "solar_system_stats": "Tirakoobka Nidaamka Qorraxda",
      "the_sun_contains_99_86_of_all_solar_sy": "Qorraxdu waxay ka kooban tahay 99.86% cufka nidaamka qorraxda oo dhan. Jupiter wuxuu qaadanayaa laba-meelood-saddex-meelood ee 0.14% ee hadhay. Dhulka + wax kasta oo kalena waa inta hadhay.",
      "10_most_famous_moons": "🌑 10-ka Dayax ee Ugu Caansan",
      "from_our_own_luna_to_triton_enceladus_": "Laga bilaabo Luna-deenna ilaa Triton + Enceladus. Qaarkood way ka weyn yihiin Mercury.",
