      "why_utc_matters": "🌐 Sababta UTC Muhiimka u Tahay",
      "astronomers_report_everything_in_utc_t": "Cirbixiyeennadu wax walba UTC ayay ku soo sheegaan. Sharraxaadda aagagga waqtiga.",
      "why_we_use_utc": "Sababta aan u isticmaalno UTC",
      "utc_coordinated_universal_time_is_the_": "UTC (Waqtiga Caalamiga ah ee la Isku-duway) waa tixraaca guud. Wuxuu ku salaysan yahay saacadaha atamka.",
      "astronomers_report_events_in_utc_so_ob": "Cirbixiyeennadu dhacdooyinka waxay ku soo sheegaan UTC si goobaha indha-indheynta ee adduunka oo dhan ay u isbarbardhigi karaan. SpaceX duulimaadyadiisa UTC ayuu ku qabtaa. Hawlgallada NASA-na UTC ayay ku jiraan.",
      "maine_utc_5_est_or_utc_4_edt_london_ut": "Maine: UTC-5 (EST) ama UTC-4 (EDT). Landan: UTC+0 (GMT) ama UTC+1 (BST). Jabbaan: UTC+9.",
      "tip_when_you_read_an_astronomy_event_t": "Talo: marka aad akhrido jadwalka dhacdooyinka cirbixiyeenimada, had iyo jeer hubi inuu yahay UTC ama waqtiga deegaanka.",
      "utc_replaced_gmt_in_1972_based_on_atom": "UTC wuxuu 1972 beddelay GMT. Wuxuu ku salaysan yahay saacadaha atamka ee shaybaarrada qaranka ee adduunka oo dhan, oo celcelis lagu sameeyay. Ilbiriqsiyo dheeraad ah ayaa la daraa marka loo baahdo.",
      "final_inspiration": "✨ Dhiirrigelinta Ugu Dambeysa",
