      "astronomy_bucket_list": "✅ Liiska Hammiga Cirbixiyeenimada",
      "15_cosmic_experiences_worth_chasing_mo": "15 waayo-aragnimo koonka ah oo mudan in la raacdeeyo. Intooda badan waa bilaash + waa la gaadhi karaa.",
