      "contrast": "Kala-duwanaansho",
      "wcag_contrast_checker_for_accessibilit": "Hubiyaha kala-duwanaanshaha WCAG ee helitaanka",
      "educational_concepts": "💡 Fikradaha Waxbarasho",
      "color_theory_additive_vs_subtractive_m": "Aragtida midabka (isku-dar ku-dar iyo ka-jar, midabbo isku-dhammaystiraya, HSL/RGB), qalooca xisaabeed (hypotrochoids, Lissajous), fractals iyo is-ekaanshaha, joomatariga jiingadaha, aragtida indhaha ee Op Art, heerarka helitaanka WCAG, iyo farshaxanka kombiyuutarka. Qalab kastaa wuxuu baraa xisaabta ka danbeysa quruxda.",
      "got_it_let_s_create": "Waan fahmay — aynu abuurno! 🎨",
