      "contrast_2": "Kala-duwanaansho",
      "color_wheel_hsl_hsv_complementary_pair": "Giraanta Midabka — HSL/HSV + labo-lab isku-dhammaystiraya",
      "hue_0_360_around_the_wheel_saturation_": "Hue (0-360 giraanta hareeraheeda), saturation (nadaafad), iftiin. Kuwa isku-dhammaystira way is-hor fadhiyaan, kuwa isku dhow way deriskaa, saddexdu waxay ku kala fog yihiin 120°. Newton wuxuu iftiinka giraanta saaray sanadkii 1666.",
      "color_mixer_subtractive_vs_additive": "Isku-darka Midabka — ka-jarid iyo ku-darid",
      "paint_and_print_subtractive_cmy_mixes_": "Rinjiga iyo daabacaadda = ka-jarid (CMY isku-darkoodu wuxuu noqonayaa madow); iftiinka iyo shaashadaha = ku-darid (RGB isku-darkoodu wuxuu noqonayaa caddaan. Isku adduun, laakiin xisaab gebi ahaanba kala duwan — daabacaha wuxuu ku fikiraa saxanka K, telefishanku wuxuu ku fikiraa Hz.",
      "pixel_art_bitmap_craft_at_8_8_to_32_32": "Farshaxanka Pixel — farsamada bitmap laga bilaabo 8×8 ilaa 32×32",
      "each_pixel_is_a_deliberate_decision_ne": "Pixel kastaa waa go'aan ula kac ah. Sprites-ka NES waxaa lagu yaqaanaa in geesi lagu geliyo 16×16 iyadoo la isticmaalayo afar midab. Algorithm-ka xariiqda ee Bresenham wuxuu sawiraa xariiqyo dhinac ah iyada oo aan la isticmaalin tirooyin dhibco leh.",
      "symmetry_reflection_rotation_glide": "Isku-ekaansho — muraayad, wareeg, siibasho",
      "bilateral_mirror_rotational_n_fold_poi": "Labo-dhinac (muraayad), wareeg (n-laab), dhibic. 17-ka koox ee naqshadaha derbiga ayaa kala saara naqshad kasta oo 2D ah oo isku celcelinaysa — shaqada Escher oo dhan.",
      "spirograph_hypotrochoid_roulettes": "Spirograph — qalooca hypotrochoid",
      "a_small_circle_rolls_inside_a_big_one_": "Goobaabin yar ayaa mid weyn gudaheeda ku giringirata, qalinkuna wuxuu ka fog yahay bartamaha. Saamiga labada raadiyas ayaa go'aaminaya tirada caleemaha ubaxa; fogaantuna waxay go'aaminaysaa dhumucda. Alaabtan ciyaarta ah waxaa la diiwaan geliyay 1965, laakiin xisaabteedu waxay ka timid 1700-meeyadii.",
      "generative_algorithm_randomness_as_art": "Abuuris — algorithm + kala-bar sida farshaxanle",
      "sol_lewitt_wrote_instructions_the_wall": "Sol LeWitt wuxuu qoray tilmaamo; kii derbiga ka shaqeeyayna wuxuu ahaa fuliyaha. Maanta: Processing, p5.js, Cinder. “Farshaxanluhu waa xeerka, ma aha natiijada.”",
      "spin_art_centripetal_physics_in_paint": "Farshaxanka Wareegga — fiisikiska xoogga bartamaha u jiida ee rinjiga",
      "drop_paint_spin_watch_it_fling_outward": "Rinji ku dhufo, wareeji, oo daawo sida uu dibedda ugu firdhayo qaab wareegsan. Damien Hirst wuxuu malaayiin ka helay iibinta sawirrada wareegga. Isla fiisikiskii wareejiyaha salad; F = mω²r.",
      "string_art_curves_from_straight_lines": "Farshaxanka Xadhigga — qalooc ka soo baxa xariiqyo toosan",
      "connect_every_n_th_nail_an_envelope_cu": "Isku xir musmaar kasta oo n-aad ah; qalooc envelope ah ayaa soo baxaya. Mary Everest Boole ayaa tan u soo bandhigtay sidii xisaab fasal qiyaastii 1900. Cardioid-ka xariiqyada toosan weli aad buu u soo jiitaa.",
      "op_art_fooling_the_visual_system": "Op Art — khiyaanaynta nidaamka aragga",
      "bridget_riley_s_moir_fields_vasarely_s": "Beeraha moiré ee Bridget Riley, shabagyada Vasarely. Unugyada cidhifka maskaxda ee dhaqdhaqaaqa ogaada ayaa xad-dhaaf u shaqeeya marka kala-duwanaanshuhu si dhakhso ah is-beddelo — bogguna wuxuu u muuqdaa mid *gariiraya*.",
      "tessellation_the_17_wallpaper_groups": "Jiingado — 17-ka koox ee naqshadaha derbiga",
      "every_periodic_2d_tiling_fits_one_of_1": "Jiingad kasta oo 2D ah oo isku celcelinaysa waxay ku dhacdaa mid ka mid ah 17-ka koox ee isku-ekaanshaha. Escher wuxuu tan ogaaday markuu Alhambra booqday 1936; kadibna wuxuu 30 sano ku bixiyay dhammaystirka liiskaas.",
      "fractal_self_similar_at_every_scale": "Fractal — nafteeda u eg heer kasta",
      "mandelbrot_1975_cauliflower_coastlines": "Mandelbrot 1975. Kaballaash ubax leh, xeebaha, xididdada dhiigga, hillaaca, kiishashka hawada sambabbada — dhammaantood waa fractal. “Daruuruhu ma aha kubbado, buuruhuna ma aha koon, qolofta geedkuna ma aha mid siman.”",
      "gradient_smooth_color_transitions": "Gradient — is-beddel midab oo siman",
      "css_gives_you_linear_radial_and_conic_": "CSS wuxuu ku siinayaa gradient toosan, goobaabin, iyo conic. Qaanso-roobaadka dhabta ah wuxuu leeyahay iftiin sii socda (ma jiraan xariiqyo kala go'an) — “7-da midab ee qaanso-roobaadka” waxay ahayd doorasho Newton uu naftiisa u sameeyay sababo muusig awgood.",
      "stereogram_3d_from_a_flat_page": "Stereogram — 3D oo ka yimid bog fidsan",
      "90s_magic_eye_craze_each_eye_sees_a_sl": "Jacaylkii Magic Eye ee 90-meeyadii. Il kastaa waxay aragtaa nooc yar oo kala duwan; haddaad indhahaaga si sax ah isu dhaafiso ama u kala fogeyso, maskaxdaadu way isku darayaan si ay qoto u noqdaan. Qiyaastii 5% dadka runtii ma awoodaan — ma aha khaladkooda.",
      "contrast_wcag_4_5_1_3_1_apca": "Kala-duwanaansho — WCAG 4.5:1 / 3:1 / APCA",
      "wcag_2_1_normal_text_4_5_1_large_3_1_w": "WCAG 2.1: qoraal caadi ah 4.5:1, mid weyn 3:1. Sababta kala-duwanaanshaha hooseeyaa u dhibo akhristayaasha aragga liita, xitaa haddii adigu akhrisan kartid. APCA (kii ku xigay WCAG 3.0) wuxuu isticmaalaa iftiinka dareenka, ma aha saamiga iftiinka ceyriin.",
      "harmony_lab_title": "Isku-waafaq - cod, saami, iyo midab",
      "harmony_lab_hint": "Isbarbardhig kala fogaanshaha codadka ee isku waafaqsan iyo kuwa aan isku waafaqsanayn, ku xir saamiga soo noqnoqoshada naqshadda, oo u turjun xiriirka muusigga isku-waafaq arag ah.",
