      "rainbow_many_vivid_hues": "🌈 Qaanso-roobaad (midabbo badan oo dhalaalaya)",
      "energetic_playful_childrens_design": "Firfircoon, ciyaartoy — naqshadda carruurta.",
      "color_harmony_discovery": "🎶 Helitaanka isku-waafaqa midabka",
      "adjust_base_hue_saturation_lightness_v": "Hagaaji hue aasaasiga ah, saturation, kala duwanaanshaha iftiinka, wareegga, iyo cabbirka midabbada. Qalabku wuxuu si toos ah u muujiyaa midabbo isku waafaqsan, wuxuuna u kala saaraa mid ka mid ah shanta nooc ee isku-waafaqa. Dhibco ma jiraan, jawaab la muujiyo ma jirto — kaliya isku day oo fiiri isku-darka kee uu keenayo isku-waafaqa kee.",
      "log": "📋 Diiwaan",
      "reset": "↺ Dib u deji",
      "hypothesis_free_text_no_right_answer_w": "Malo-awaal (qoraal xor ah — jawaab sax ah ma jirto): Maxaa ka dhigaya midabbo inay u dareemaan isku waafaqsan halkii ay ka noqon lahaayeen kuwo qalqal leh?",
      "stuck_show_open_prompts_no_answers": "🤔 Waad istaagtay — muuji su'aalo furan (jawaabo ma jiraan)",
      "open_prompts_investigate_by_manipulati": "Su'aalo furan — baar adigoo wax beddelaya:",
      "find_the_smallest_palette_that_still_f": "Hel midabbada ugu yar ee weli kuu dareemaya inay \"dhammaystiran\" yihiin.",
      "real_impressionists_used_analogous_pal": "Rinjiyeyaashii dhabta ahaa ee impressionist-ka waxay isticmaali jireen midabbo isku dhow. Maxay u ahayd sidaas?",
      "some_color_schemes_have_proper_names_c": "Qaar ka mid ah habaynta midabku magacyo rasmi ah ayay leeyihiin (isku-dhammaystir, isku-dhammaystir kala qaybsan, saddexley). Raadi kuwaas oo isku day inaad dib u sameyso.",
      "high_saturation_many_colors_busy_try_d": "Saturation sare + midabbo badan = qalqal. Isku day inaad saturation-ka ku yareyso sliderka isku-darka — maxaa ku dhacaya \"isku-waafaqa\"?",
      "i_think_i_understand_color_harmony_now": "Waxaan filayaa inaan hadda fahmay isku-waafaqa midabka — aan erayadayda ku sharraxo",
      "explain_in_your_own_words_how_do_hue_s": "Erayadaada ku sharrax: sidee kala fogaanshaha hue, saturation, iyo cabbirka midabbadu u go'aamiyaan \"isku-waafaqa\"?",
      "design_note_discrete_5_state_harmony_m": "Xusuusin naqshadeyn: calaamad isku-waafaq oo shan xaaladood oo kala duwan leh; giraanta SVG waxay muujinaysaa booskooda; dhibco \"midabbo wanaagsan\" ma jiraan — si ula kac ah ayaa loo sameeyay.",
