      "chemotactile_sensors_in_octopus_sucker": "Chemotactile sensors in octopus suckers",
      "chimpanzee": "Chimpanzee",
      "choose_one_project_from_the_project_id": "CHOOSE one project from the Project Ideas tab. DESIGN your approach. EXECUTE the work. PRESENT to class. DOCUMENT your process. DUE: 2 weeks after assignment.",
