      "eight_years_after_qualifying_you_are_t": "Eight years after qualifying you are the trusted foreman. Your master makes you a partial partner. When he dies in 1502 you inherit a share + keep the shop running with his widow until she remarries. Comfortable, respected, never famous. Your name is in one surviving guild ledger.",
