      "tanks_ship_hulls_boilers_storage_vesse": "Tanks, ship hulls, boilers, storage vessels — enclosed spaces not designed for human occupancy with limited entry/exit.",
      "teacher_notes_click_to_expand": "🍎 Teacher Notes — click to expand",
