        "image_alt": "Sawirro qaarkii ma laha qoraal alt. Ardayda isticmaala akhriyayaasha shaashadda (ardayda indhoolaha ah ama aragtida hooseysa) ma maqli doonaan waxba ama kaliya magaca faylka marka sawirkani muuqdo.",
