        "button_name": "Badhanku ma laha magac uu akhriyaha shaashadda u dhawaaqi karo. Ardayga wuxuu maqli lahaa kaliya \"button\" la'aan macno.",
        "link_name": "Xidhiidhku ma laha qoraal ama aria-label. Isticmaalayaasha akhriyaha shaashadda ma garan doonaan halka uu u horseedo.",
        "label": "Geliyaha foomku ma laha calaamad. Ardayda isticmaala akhriyayaasha shaashadda ama aqoonsiga hadalka ma garan doonaan waxay galiyaan.",
        "aria_required_attr": "Elementiga wuxuu leeyahay door ARIA laakiin maqan tahay sifooyin loo baahan yahay. Isticmaalayaasha akhriyaha shaashadda waxay heli karaan macluumaad khalkhalsanaadi ama macluumaad ma haysto.",
        "aria_roles": "Elementigu wuxuu isticmaalaa door ARIA oo aan sax ahayn. Akhriyayaasha shaashaduhu waxay iska dhaafi karaan ama way u dhaqmaan si lama filaan ah.",
        "aria_valid_attr": "Elementiga wuxuu leeyahay sifa ARIA oo aan sax ahayn. Tilmaanta helitaanka waa la iska indhasarcadayaa.",
