        "duplicate_id": "Laba elementi waxay wadaagaan isla id. Akhriyayaasha shaashadda iyo calaamadaha waxay ku xidhmi karaan midka khaldan.",
        "duplicate_id_aria": "ID-yada labanlaabka ah waxay faragelinayaan calaamadeynta ARIA.",
        "document_title": "Bogga ma laha <title>. Akhriyayaasha shaashadda iyo liiska tab-ka kuma garan doonaan.",
        "html_has_lang": "Bogga waxaa maqan sifo lang ah. Akhriyayaasha shaashadda ma garan doonaan dhawaaq la isticmaalo.",
        "html_lang_valid": "Sifo lang ee bogga ma ahan koodh luqad sax ah.",
        "landmark_one_main": "Bogga waxaa maqan calaamadda <main>. Isticmaalayaasha akhriyaha shaashadda waxay ku adag yahay inay boodaan navigation-ka oo ay gaaraan nuxurka ugu muhiimsan.",
        "region": "Nuxur qaarkii ma jiro calaamadda (header, main, nav, footer). Isticmaalayaasha akhriyaha shaashadda waxay ku dhibsan karaan navigation.",
