  "readinglib_openstax_ai_off": "Gudbinta AI ee OpenStax way dansan tahay; helitaanka aan AI adeegsan iyo dhoofintu way sii jiraan.",
  "readinglib_openstax_mirror_notice": "Nuqulka cutubka OpenStax ee u diyaarsan helitaanka · CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 · akhriska iyo helitaanka aan AI adeegsan way sii jiraan · U saar Isha iyo gudbinta AI-abuurka waa la xannibay ilaa OpenStax oggolaansho bixiyo.",
  "readinglib_opt1_body": "Buugaagta sawirrada ee StoryWeaver oo asal ah, lehna qoraal uu daabacuhu xaqiijiyey. Qaar badan cod ayaa loo akhriyey iyadoo eray kasta la iftiiminayo. Adeegso shaandhada luqadda ee kore.",
  "readinglib_opt1_title": "Buugaagta maktabadda — kuwa ugu kalsoonida badan",
  "readinglib_opt2_body": "Fur buug kasta oo riix 🌐 Turjun. Waxay xitaa u shaqaysaa luqadaha aanu StoryWeaver daabicin (Soomaali, Yukreeniyaan, …), cod-ku-akhriskuna weli wuu shaqaynayaa. Qoraalka waxaa sameeyey AI — daabacuhu dib uma eegin — cod-akhriska eray-erayguna wuxuu ku jiraa asalka oo keliya. Waxay maanta ku fiican tahay taageerada ardayda cusub; marka aad awooddo ardayda la barbar dhig asalka.",
  "readinglib_opt2_title": "Turjumaad AI oo degdeg ah — luqad kasta, hadda",
  "readinglib_opt3_body": "StoryWeaver wuxuu ku daabacaa in ka badan 300 luqadood. Mid kasta waxaa qoraal la xaqiijiyey (iyo cod haddii uu jiro) loogu dari karaa maktabaddan cusboonaysiin ab oo degdeg ah — u sheeg maamulaha AlloFlow luqadda aad u baahan tahay.",
